ics and PASS Method","description":"A theoretical session covering common causes of fires, types of fire extinguishers (Class A, B, C, D, K), and a detailed demonstration of the \'PASS\' (Pull, Aim, Squeeze, Sweep) method for operating a fire extinguisher."},{"time":"09:00","label":"Hands-on Practice: Fire Extinguisher Operation","description":"Participants will individually practice the \'PASS\' method using training fire extinguishers on a controlled, simulated fire (e.g., a fire pan with controlled fuel or a water-based fire simulator). Emphasis on proper stance and technique."},{"time":"09:40","label":"Scenario Simulation: Responding to a Small Fire Incident","description":"A controlled functional exercise where participants respond to a simulated small electrical fire in a designated area. Participants will assess the situation, decide on appropriate action, and apply the fire extinguisher as practiced."},{"time":"10:05","label":"Debriefing and Open Forum","description":"A facilitated discussion to review the exercise, gather feedback from participants, discuss lessons learned, identify strengths and areas for improvement in fire response."},{"time":"10:13","label":"Wrap-up and Closing Remarks","description":"Summary of key takeaways, acknowledgment of participants and personnel, and final announcements."}],"post_evaluation":null,"resources":[{"id":1,"name":"Fire Extinguisher","category":"PPE","description":null,"quantity":10,"available":5,"reserved_quantity":0,"in_use_quantity":0,"needs_repair_quantity":0,"pending_quantity":0,"condition":"Good","status":"Partially Assigned","location":"Storage Room A","serial_number":"FE-001-2025","image_url":null,"assigned_to_event_id":5,"assigned_handler_id":3,"maintenance_status":"No","last_maintenance_date":null,"last_inspection_date":null,"created_by":1,"updated_by":3,"resource_budget_proposal_id":null,"resource_budget_proposal_item_id":null,"created_at":"2026-06-27T12:04:21.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T08:43:49.0000