	(2, 3, 1, 'archived', '[{"number":1,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"According to the lesson, what is fire primarily defined as?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang pangunahing kahulugan ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Fire is a chemical reaction called combustion, which occurs when three essential elements combine: Heat Fuel Oxygen\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Ang sunog ay isang kemikal na reaksyon na tinatawag na kombustyon, na nangyayari kapag nagsama-sama ang tatlong mahahalagang elemento: Init, Gatong, Oxygen\'.","choice_a_en":"A physical reaction producing light and heat","choice_a_fil":"Isang pisikal na reaksyon na gumagawa ng liwanag at init","choice_b_en":"A chemical reaction called combustion","choice_b_fil":"Isang kemikal na reaksyon na tinatawag na kombustyon","choice_c_en":"A rapid expansion of hot gases","choice_c_fil":"Isang mabilis na paglawak ng mainit na gas","choice_d_en":"A phenomenon of rapid material decomposition","choice_d_fil":"Isang phenomenon ng mabilis na pagkabulok ng materyal"},{"number":2,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which three essential elements combine to form the Fire Triangle?","question_fil":"Aling tatlong mahahalagang elemento ang nagsasama-sama upang mabuo ang Fire Triangle?","explanation_en":"The lesson identifies the three elements forming the Fire Triangle as \'Heat Fuel Oxygen\'.","explanation_fil":"Tinukoy ng aralin ang tatlong elementong bumubuo sa Fire Triangle bilang \'Init, Gatong, Oxygen\'.","choice_a_en":"Light, Fuel, Oxygen","choice_a_fil":"Liwanag, Gatong, Oxygen","choice_b_en":"Heat, Fuel, Oxygen","choice_b_fil":"Init, Gatong, Oxygen","choice_c_en":"Smoke, Heat, Oxygen","choice_c_fil":"Usok, Init, Oxygen","choice_d_en":"Fuel, Carbon Dioxide, Heat","choice_d_fil":"Gatong, Carbon Dioxide, Init"},{"number":3,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What will happen if any one of the three elements of the Fire Triangle is removed?","question_fil":"Ano ang mangyayari kung aalisin ang alinman sa tatlong elemento ng Fire Triangle?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'If any one of these elements is removed, the fire will be extinguished\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Kung aalisin ang alinman sa mga elementong ito, ang sunog ay mamamatay\'.","choice_a_en":"The fire will intensify","choice_a_fil":"Ang sunog ay titindi","choice_b_en":"The fire will spread","choice_b_fil":"Ang sunog ay kakalat","choice_c_en":"The fire will be extinguished","choice_c_fil":"Ang sunog ay mamamatay","choice_d_en":"The fire will change color","choice_d_fil":"Magbabago ang kulay ng apoy"},{"number":4,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"In the context of the Fire Triangle, what is the primary role of Heat?","question_fil":"Sa konteksto ng Fire Triangle, ano ang pangunahing papel ng Init?","explanation_en":"The lesson explains: \'Heat provides the energy needed to ignite combustible materials\'.","explanation_fil":"Ipinaliliwanag ng aralin: \'Nagbibigay ang Init ng enerhiya na kailangan upang pagliyabin ang mga nasusunog na materyales\'.","choice_a_en":"To act as fuel","choice_a_fil":"Para magsilbing gatong","choice_b_en":"To ignite combustible materials","choice_b_fil":"Upang pagliyabin ang mga nasusunog na materyales","choice_c_en":"To reduce oxygen supply","choice_c_fil":"Upang bawasan ang suplay ng oxygen","choice_d_en":"To increase visibility during a fire","choice_d_fil":"Upang mapataas ang kakayahang makakita sa panahon ng sunog"},{"number":5,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is an example of \'Fuel\' as defined in the Fire Triangle?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang halimbawa ng \'Gatong\' tulad ng tinukoy sa Fire Triangle?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Gasoline\' as an example of fuel, stating: \'Fuel is any combustible material that can burn. Examples: ... Gasoline\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na ang \'Gasolina\' ay halimbawa ng gatong, at sinasabing: \'Ang gatong ay anumang nasusunog na materyal na maaaring magliyab. Mga Halimbawa: ... Gasolina\'.","choice_a_en":"Electrical sparks","choice_a_fil":"Kislap ng kuryente","choice_b_en":"Open flames","choice_b_fil":"Bukas na apoy","choice_c_en":"Gasoline","choice_c_fil":"Gasolina","choice_d_en":"Oxygen","choice_d_fil":"Oxygen"},{"number":6,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What is the role of Oxygen in the Fire Triangle?","question_fil":"Ano ang papel ng Oxygen sa Fire Triangle?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Oxygen in the air supports combustion\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Ang Oxygen sa hangin ay sumusuporta sa kombustyon\'.","choice_a_en":"To cool down the fire","choice_a_fil":"Upang palamigin ang apoy","choice_b_en":"To remove fuel from the fire","choice_b_fil":"Upang alisin ang gatong mula sa apoy","choice_c_en":"To support combustion","choice_c_fil":"Upang suportahan ang kombustyon","choice_d_en":"To provide a barrier against fire spread","choice_d_fil":"Upang magbigay ng harang laban sa pagkalat ng apoy"},{"number":7,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Removing oxygen, such as by covering a fire with a fire blanket, can extinguish what type of fires?","question_fil":"Ang pag-alis ng oxygen, tulad ng pagtakip sa sunog gamit ang fire blanket, ay makasusugpo ng anong uri ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson mentions: \'Removing oxygen (such as covering a fire with a fire blanket) can extinguish certain types of fires\'.","explanation_fil":"Binanggit sa aralin: \'Ang pag-alis ng oxygen (tulad ng pagtakip sa sunog gamit ang fire blanket) ay makasusugpo ng ilang uri ng sunog\'.","choice_a_en":"Only electrical fires","choice_a_fil":"Mga sunog na elektrikal lamang","choice_b_en":"Only liquid fires","choice_b_fil":"Mga sunog na likido lamang","choice_c_en":"Certain types of fires","choice_c_fil":"Ilang uri ng sunog","choice_d_en":"All types of fires","choice_d_fil":"Lahat ng uri ng sunog"},{"number":8,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Class A Fires involve which type of materials?","question_fil":"Anong uri ng materyales ang nasasangkot sa Class A Fires?","explanation_en":"The lesson defines: \'Class A Fires Ordinary combustible materials\'.","explanation_fil":"Ang aralin ay nagbibigay-kahulugan: \'Class A Fires: Mga ordinaryong materyales na nasusunog\'.","choice_a_en":"Flammable liquids","choice_a_fil":"Mga likidong madaling magliyab","choice_b_en":"Ordinary combustible materials","choice_b_fil":"Mga ordinaryong materyales na nasusunog","choice_c_en":"Energized electrical equipment","choice_c_fil":"Mga kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente","choice_d_en":"Reactive metals","choice_d_fil":"Mga reaktibong metal"},{"number":9,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is an example of a material involved in a Class A Fire?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang halimbawa ng materyal na nasasangkot sa Class A Fire?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Wood\' as an example of Class A fires: \'Examples: Wood Paper Cloth Rubber Plastic\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin ang \'Kahoy\' bilang halimbawa ng Class A fires: \'Mga Halimbawa: Kahoy, Papel, Tela, Goma, Plastik\'.","choice_a_en":"Gasoline","choice_a_fil":"Gasolina","choice_b_en":"Paint","choice_b_fil":"Pintura","choice_c_en":"Wood","choice_c_fil":"Kahoy","choice_d_en":"Electrical panel","choice_d_fil":"Electrical panel"},{"number":10,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What materials are involved in Class B Fires?","question_fil":"Anong materyales ang nasasangkot sa Class B Fires?","explanation_en":"The lesson specifies: \'Class B Fires Flammable liquids\'.","explanation_fil":"Tinukoy ng aralin: \'Class B Fires: Mga likidong madaling magliyab\'.","choice_a_en":"Ordinary combustibles","choice_a_fil":"Mga ordinaryong nasusunog","choice_b_en":"Flammable gases","choice_b_fil":"Mga gas na madaling magliyab","choice_c_en":"Flammable liquids","choice_c_fil":"Mga likidong madaling magliyab","choice_d_en":"Cooking oils","choice_d_fil":"Mga mantika sa pagluluto"},{"number":11,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"An alcohol fire would be classified under which fire class?","question_fil":"Sa anong klase ng sunog maiuuri ang sunog na dulot ng alkohol?","explanation_en":"The lesson includes \'Alcohol\' as an example of a Class B fire: \'Examples: Gasoline Diesel Paint Oil Alcohol\'.","explanation_fil":"Kasama sa aralin ang \'Alcohol\' bilang halimbawa ng Class B fire: \'Mga Halimbawa: Gasolina, Diesel, Pintura, Langis, Alkohol\'.","choice_a_en":"Class A","choice_a_fil":"Class A","choice_b_en":"Class B","choice_b_fil":"Class B","choice_c_en":"Class C","choice_c_fil":"Class C","choice_d_en":"Class D","choice_d_fil":"Class D"},{"number":12,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Class C Fires involve what kind of equipment?","question_fil":"Anong uri ng kagamitan ang nasasangkot sa Class C Fires?","explanation_en":"The lesson defines: \'Class C Fires Electrical fires involving energized electrical equipment\'.","explanation_fil":"Ang aralin ay nagbibigay-kahulugan: \'Class C Fires: Mga sunog na elektrikal na nasasangkot sa mga kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente\'.","choice_a_en":"Ordinary combustible materials","choice_a_fil":"Mga ordinaryong materyales na nasusunog","choice_b_en":"Flammable liquids","choice_b_fil":"Mga likidong madaling magliyab","choice_c_en":"Energized electrical equipment","choice_c_fil":"Mga kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente","choice_d_en":"Combustible metals","choice_d_fil":"Mga metal na nasusunog"},{"number":13,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is an example of a potential Class C fire hazard?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang halimbawa ng posibleng panganib ng Class C fire?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Overloaded electrical outlets\' as a common fire hazard, which directly relates to energized electrical equipment (Class C fires).","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin ang \'Mga labis na kargadong saksakan ng kuryente\' bilang isang karaniwang panganib ng sunog, na direktang nauugnay sa mga kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente (Class C fires).","choice_a_en":"Burning paper","choice_a_fil":"Nasusunog na papel","choice_b_en":"Leaking diesel","choice_b_fil":"Tumutulong diesel","choice_c_en":"An overloaded electrical outlet","choice_c_fil":"Isang labis na kargadong saksakan ng kuryente","choice_d_en":"A stack of rubber tires","choice_d_fil":"Tumpok ng gulong na goma"},{"number":14,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which of the following is identified as a common fire hazard in the lesson?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang tinukoy bilang karaniwang panganib ng sunog sa aralin?","explanation_en":"The lesson explicitly lists \'Unattended cooking\' as a common fire hazard.","explanation_fil":"Malinaw na nakasaad sa aralin ang \'Hindi binabantayang pagluluto\' bilang isang karaniwang panganib ng sunog.","choice_a_en":"Properly stored flammable materials","choice_a_fil":"Wastong nakaimbak na mga materyales na madaling magliyab","choice_b_en":"Unattended cooking","choice_b_fil":"Hindi binabantayang pagluluto","choice_c_en":"Adequate ventilation","choice_c_fil":"Sapat na bentilasyon","choice_d_en":"Covered electrical outlets","choice_d_fil":"Mga saksakan ng kuryente na may takip"},{"number":15,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"According to the lesson, what is the primary cause of many fire-related deaths?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang pangunahing sanhi ng maraming pagkamatay na may kaugnayan sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Many fire-related deaths are caused by smoke inhalation rather than burns\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Maraming pagkamatay na may kaugnayan sa sunog ang sanhi ng pagsinghot ng usok sa halip na pagkasunog\'.","choice_a_en":"Burns from flames","choice_a_fil":"Pagkasunog mula sa apoy","choice_b_en":"Structural collapse","choice_b_fil":"Pagguho ng istruktura","choice_c_en":"Smoke inhalation","choice_c_fil":"Pagsinghot ng usok","choice_d_en":"Explosions","choice_d_fil":"Mga pagsabog"},{"number":16,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is a danger caused by smoke containing harmful gases?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang panganib na dulot ng usok na naglalaman ng nakakapinsalang gas?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists: \'Smoke contains harmful gases that can: ... Result in suffocation\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Naglalaman ang usok ng nakakapinsalang gas na maaaring: ... Magdulot ng pagkasakal\'.","choice_a_en":"Increased visibility","choice_a_fil":"Pagtaas ng kakayahang makakita","choice_b_en":"Enhanced breathing","choice_b_fil":"Pagpapabuti ng paghinga","choice_c_en":"Suffocation","choice_c_fil":"Pagkasakal","choice_d_en":"Accelerated healing","choice_d_fil":"Pinabilis na paggaling"},{"number":17,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"During evacuation from a fire, what specific action is recommended to avoid smoke?","question_fil":"Sa panahon ng paglikas mula sa sunog, anong tiyak na aksyon ang inirerekomenda upang maiwasan ang usok?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises: \'During evacuation: Stay low to avoid smoke\'.","explanation_fil":"Pinapayuhan ng aralin: \'Sa panahon ng paglikas: Manatili sa mababang posisyon upang maiwasan ang usok\'.","choice_a_en":"Stand tall to see better","choice_a_fil":"Tumayo nang tuwid upang mas makakita","choice_b_en":"Run quickly through smoke","choice_b_fil":"Mabilis na tumakbo sa usok","choice_c_en":"Stay low to avoid smoke","choice_c_fil":"Manatili sa mababang posisyon upang maiwasan ang usok","choice_d_en":"Hold your breath completely","choice_d_fil":"Ganap na pigilin ang paghinga"},{"number":18,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What should individuals do with their nose and mouth during evacuation if necessary?","question_fil":"Ano ang dapat gawin ng mga indibidwal sa kanilang ilong at bibig sa panahon ng paglikas kung kinakailangan?","explanation_en":"The lesson instructs: \'Cover your nose and mouth with a cloth if necessary\'.","explanation_fil":"Ipinag-uutos ng aralin: \'Takpan ang iyong ilong at bibig ng tela kung kinakailangan\'.","choice_a_en":"Keep them uncovered","choice_a_fil":"Hayaan silang walang takip","choice_b_en":"Cover them with bare hands","choice_b_fil":"Takpan sila ng walang saplot na kamay","choice_c_en":"Cover them with a cloth","choice_c_fil":"Takpan sila ng tela","choice_d_en":"Breathe deeply through them","choice_d_fil":"Huminga nang malalim sa pamamagitan nila"},{"number":19,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is a key takeaway regarding early detection and quick response in fire emergencies?","question_fil":"Ano ang pangunahing aral hinggil sa maagang pagtukoy at mabilis na pagtugon sa mga emergency sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson\'s key takeaways include: \'Early detection and quick response save lives\'.","explanation_fil":"Kasama sa mga pangunahing aral ng leksyon: \'Ang maagang pagtukoy at mabilis na pagtugon ay nakapagliligtas ng mga buhay\'.","choice_a_en":"It prevents property loss only","choice_a_fil":"Pinipigilan lamang nito ang pagkawala ng ari-arian","choice_b_en":"It saves lives","choice_b_fil":"Nakapagliligtas ito ng mga buhay","choice_c_en":"It makes evacuation easier","choice_c_fil":"Pinapadali nito ang paglikas","choice_d_en":"It speeds up fire investigation","choice_d_fil":"Pinapabilis nito ang imbestigasyon sa sunog"},{"number":20,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Why is understanding fire classifications important according to the lesson?","question_fil":"Bakit mahalaga ang pag-unawa sa mga klasipikasyon ng sunog ayon sa aralin?","explanation_en":"The lesson\'s key takeaways state: \'Understanding fire classifications helps determine the proper response\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa mga pangunahing aral ng leksyon: \'Ang pag-unawa sa mga klasipikasyon ng sunog ay nakatutulong upang matukoy ang tamang pagtugon\'.","choice_a_en":"To determine the fire\'s origin","choice_a_fil":"Upang matukoy ang pinagmulan ng sunog","choice_b_en":"To assign responsibility for the fire","choice_b_fil":"Upang magtalaga ng pananagutan para sa sunog","choice_c_en":"To determine the proper response","choice_c_fil":"Upang matukoy ang tamang pagtugon","choice_d_en":"To estimate property damage","choice_d_fil":"Upang matantiya ang pinsala sa ari-arian"}]', 'en', '{"en":{"status":"published","outdated":false,"published_at":"2026-07-16T15:28:42+08:00"},"fil":{"status":"draft","outdated":false,"translated_at":"2026-07-13T09:02:46+08:00"}}', 'AI Generated', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-16 07:28:42', 3, 3, '2026-07-13 01:02:46', '2026-07-13 01:02:05', '2026-07-16 10:34:09'),
	(3, 3, 2, 'published', '[{"number":1,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"According to the lesson overview, what is the foundation of fire safety?","question_fil":"Ayon sa pangkalahatang-ideya ng aralin, ano ang pundasyon ng kaligtasan sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Understanding how fires start, how they spread, and the risks they pose is the foundation of fire safety.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Ang pag-unawa kung paano nagsisimula ang sunog, kung paano ito kumakalat, at ang mga panganib na idudulot nito ang pundasyon ng kaligtasan sa sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"Mastering the use of fire extinguishers.","choice_a_fil":"Pagkadalubhasa sa paggamit ng fire extinguishers.","choice_b_en":"Understanding how fires start, spread, and the risks they pose.","choice_b_fil":"Pag-unawa kung paano nagsisimula, kumakalat, at ang mga panganib na idudulot ng sunog.","choice_c_en":"Knowing all types of evacuation routes.","choice_c_fil":"Pagkaalam sa lahat ng uri ng ruta ng paglikas.","choice_d_en":"Regularly participating in fire drills.","choice_d_fil":"Regular na paglahok sa mga fire drill."},{"number":2,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Fire is a chemical reaction known as what?","question_fil":"Ang sunog ay isang kemikal na reaksyon na kilala bilang ano?","explanation_en":"The lesson defines fire as \'a chemical reaction called combustion\'.","explanation_fil":"Inilalarawan ng aralin ang sunog bilang \'isang kemikal na reaksyon na tinatawag na combustion\'.","choice_a_en":"Oxidation","choice_a_fil":"Oksidasyon","choice_b_en":"Combustion","choice_b_fil":"Pagkasunog (Combustion)","choice_c_en":"Ignition","choice_c_fil":"Pagsisimula ng pagkasunog (Ignition)","choice_d_en":"Thermal decomposition","choice_d_fil":"Termal na pagkakawatak-watak"},{"number":3,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which three essential elements combine to form the Fire Triangle?","question_fil":"Aling tatlong mahahalagang elemento ang pinagsasama-sama upang mabuo ang Fire Triangle?","explanation_en":"The lesson explicitly states: \'Heat, Fuel, Oxygen These three elements form the Fire Triangle\'.","explanation_fil":"Malinaw na nakasaad sa aralin: \'Init, Panggatong, Oxygen. Ang tatlong elementong ito ang bumubuo sa Fire Triangle\'.","choice_a_en":"Smoke, Heat, Fuel","choice_a_fil":"Usok, Init, Panggatong","choice_b_en":"Heat, Fuel, Oxygen","choice_b_fil":"Init, Panggatong, Oxygen","choice_c_en":"Oxygen, Sparks, Wood","choice_c_fil":"Oxygen, Kislap, Kahoy","choice_d_en":"Fuel, Flames, Carbon Dioxide","choice_d_fil":"Panggatong, Apoy, Carbon Dioxide"},{"number":4,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What happens if any one of the three elements of the Fire Triangle is removed?","question_fil":"Ano ang mangyayari kung aalisin ang alinman sa tatlong elemento ng Fire Triangle?","explanation_en":"The lesson explains: \'If any one of these elements is removed, the fire will be extinguished\'.","explanation_fil":"Ipinaliwanag ng aralin: \'Kung aalisin ang alinman sa mga elementong ito, mawawala ang sunog\'.","choice_a_en":"The fire will reduce in size but continue to burn.","choice_a_fil":"Liliit ang sunog ngunit patuloy itong magliliyab.","choice_b_en":"The fire will change its classification.","choice_b_fil":"Magbabago ang klasipikasyon ng sunog.","choice_c_en":"The fire will be extinguished.","choice_c_fil":"Mawawala ang sunog.","choice_d_en":"The fire will generate more smoke.","choice_d_fil":"Ang sunog ay magbubunga ng mas maraming usok."},{"number":5,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is an example of a heat source mentioned in the lesson?","question_fil":"Alin sa sumusunod ang halimbawa ng pinagmumulan ng init na binanggit sa aralin?","explanation_en":"Under the \'Heat\' section, \'Electrical sparks\' is listed as an example.","explanation_fil":"Sa ilalim ng seksyon na \'Init\', nakalista ang \'Kislap ng kuryente\' bilang isang halimbawa.","choice_a_en":"Paper","choice_a_fil":"Papel","choice_b_en":"LPG","choice_b_fil":"LPG","choice_c_en":"Electrical sparks","choice_c_fil":"Kislap ng kuryente","choice_d_en":"Plastic","choice_d_fil":"Plastik"},{"number":6,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of these materials is explicitly listed as a \'Fuel\' element for a fire?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga materyales na ito ang malinaw na nakalista bilang elementong \'Panggatong\' para sa sunog?","explanation_en":"Under the \'Fuel\' section, \'Wood\' is listed as an example of a combustible material.","explanation_fil":"Sa ilalim ng seksyon na \'Panggatong\', nakalista ang \'Kahoy\' bilang halimbawa ng nasusunog na materyal.","choice_a_en":"Water","choice_a_fil":"Tubig","choice_b_en":"Oxygen","choice_b_fil":"Oxygen","choice_c_en":"Wood","choice_c_fil":"Kahoy","choice_d_en":"Carbon Dioxide","choice_d_fil":"Carbon Dioxide"},{"number":7,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What is the primary role of Oxygen in the Fire Triangle?","question_fil":"Ano ang pangunahing papel ng Oxygen sa Fire Triangle?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Oxygen in the air supports combustion\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Sinusuportahan ng oxygen sa hangin ang pagkasunog\'.","choice_a_en":"To cool down combustible materials.","choice_a_fil":"Upang palamigin ang mga nasusunog na materyales.","choice_b_en":"To remove harmful gases.","choice_b_fil":"Upang alisin ang mga nakakapinsalang gas.","choice_c_en":"To support combustion.","choice_c_fil":"Upang suportahan ang pagkasunog.","choice_d_en":"To act as a fire retardant.","choice_d_fil":"Upang magsilbing fire retardant."},{"number":8,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Class A Fires involve what type of combustible materials?","question_fil":"Anong uri ng nasusunog na materyales ang kasama sa Class A Fires?","explanation_en":"The lesson defines \'Class A Fires\' as involving \'Ordinary combustible materials\'.","explanation_fil":"Inilalarawan ng aralin ang \'Class A Fires\' bilang kinasasangkutan ng \'Karaniwang nasusunog na materyales\'.","choice_a_en":"Flammable liquids","choice_a_fil":"Madaling magliyab na likido","choice_b_en":"Gases and vapors","choice_b_fil":"Mga gas at singaw","choice_c_en":"Ordinary combustible materials","choice_c_fil":"Karaniwang nasusunog na materyales","choice_d_en":"Energized electrical equipment","choice_d_fil":"Kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente"},{"number":9,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which of the following is an example of a fuel typically found in a Class A fire?","question_fil":"Alin sa sumusunod ang halimbawa ng panggatong na karaniwang matatagpuan sa isang Class A fire?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Paper\' as an example for Class A Fires (Ordinary combustible materials).","explanation_fil":"Nakalista ang \'Papel\' sa aralin bilang halimbawa para sa Class A Fires (Karaniwang nasusunog na materyales).","choice_a_en":"Gasoline","choice_a_fil":"Gasolina","choice_b_en":"Paper","choice_b_fil":"Papel","choice_c_en":"Diesel","choice_c_fil":"Diesel","choice_d_en":"Alcohol","choice_d_fil":"Alcohol"},{"number":10,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What type of materials are involved in Class B fires?","question_fil":"Anong uri ng materyales ang kasama sa Class B fires?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Class B Fires Flammable liquids\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Class B Fires: Madaling magliyab na likido\'.","choice_a_en":"Ordinary combustibles","choice_a_fil":"Karaniwang nasusunog na materyales","choice_b_en":"Flammable liquids","choice_b_fil":"Madaling magliyab na likido","choice_c_en":"Energized electrical equipment","choice_c_fil":"Kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente","choice_d_en":"Combustible metals","choice_d_fil":"Nasusunog na metal"},{"number":11,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Gasoline is an example of a fuel involved in which class of fire?","question_fil":"Ang gasolina ay isang halimbawa ng panggatong na kasama sa aling klase ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Gasoline\' as an example for Class B Fires (Flammable liquids).","explanation_fil":"Nakalista ang \'Gasolina\' sa aralin bilang halimbawa para sa Class B Fires (Madaling magliyab na likido).","choice_a_en":"Class A","choice_a_fil":"Class A","choice_b_en":"Class B","choice_b_fil":"Class B","choice_c_en":"Class C","choice_c_fil":"Class C","choice_d_en":"Class D","choice_d_fil":"Class D"},{"number":12,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Class C fires are characterized by involving what?","question_fil":"Ang Class C fires ay inilalarawan sa pamamagitan ng pagkasangkot ng ano?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Class C Fires Electrical fires involving energized electrical equipment\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Class C Fires: Mga sunog na elektrikal na kinasasangkutan ng kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente\'.","choice_a_en":"Cooking oils and fats","choice_a_fil":"Mga mantika at taba sa pagluluto","choice_b_en":"Flammable gases","choice_b_fil":"Madaling magliyab na gas","choice_c_en":"Energized electrical equipment","choice_c_fil":"Kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente","choice_d_en":"Reactive metals","choice_d_fil":"Mga reaktibong metal"},{"number":13,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"An electrical panel fire would be classified as which type of fire?","question_fil":"Ang sunog sa electrical panel ay ikakategorya bilang anong uri ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Electrical panels\' as an example for Class C Fires (Electrical fires involving energized electrical equipment).","explanation_fil":"Nakalista ang \'Mga electrical panel\' sa aralin bilang halimbawa para sa Class C Fires (Mga sunog na elektrikal na kinasasangkutan ng kagamitang elektrikal na may kuryente).","choice_a_en":"Class A","choice_a_fil":"Class A","choice_b_en":"Class B","choice_b_fil":"Class B","choice_c_en":"Class C","choice_c_fil":"Class C","choice_d_en":"Class K","choice_d_fil":"Class K"},{"number":14,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which of the following is explicitly listed as a common fire hazard in the lesson?","question_fil":"Alin sa sumusunod ang malinaw na nakalista bilang karaniwang panganib sa sunog sa aralin?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Overloaded electrical outlets\' as an example of a common fire hazard.","explanation_fil":"Nakalista sa aralin ang \'Mga saksakan ng kuryente na labis ang karga\' bilang halimbawa ng karaniwang panganib sa sunog.","choice_a_en":"Properly maintained smoke detectors","choice_a_fil":"Wastong pinapanatili na smoke detectors","choice_b_en":"Overloaded electrical outlets","choice_b_fil":"Mga saksakan ng kuryente na labis ang karga","choice_c_en":"Fire-resistant building materials","choice_c_fil":"Mga materyales sa gusali na lumalaban sa sunog","choice_d_en":"Adequate emergency exits","choice_d_fil":"Sapat na emergency exits"},{"number":15,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is \'Improper LPG storage\' identified as in the lesson?","question_fil":"Ano ang pagkakakilanlan ng \'Di-wastong pag-iimbak ng LPG\' sa aralin?","explanation_en":"The lesson explicitly lists \'Improper LPG storage\' under \'Common Fire Hazards\'.","explanation_fil":"Malinaw na nakalista ang \'Di-wastong pag-iimbak ng LPG\' sa aralin sa ilalim ng \'Mga Karaniwang Panganib sa Sunog\'.","choice_a_en":"A type of fuel","choice_a_fil":"Isang uri ng panggatong","choice_b_en":"A fire hazard","choice_b_fil":"Isang panganib sa sunog","choice_c_en":"A method of fire suppression","choice_c_fil":"Isang paraan ng pagsugpo sa sunog","choice_d_en":"A component of the Fire Triangle","choice_d_fil":"Isang bahagi ng Fire Triangle"},{"number":16,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Why are many fire-related deaths caused by smoke inhalation rather than burns?","question_fil":"Bakit maraming pagkamatay na may kaugnayan sa sunog ang sanhi ng paglanghap ng usok sa halip na paso?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Many fire-related deaths are caused by smoke inhalation rather than burns. Smoke contains harmful gases that can...Lead to unconsciousness Result in suffocation\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Maraming pagkamatay na may kaugnayan sa sunog ang sanhi ng paglanghap ng usok sa halip na paso. Naglalaman ang usok ng nakakapinsalang gas na maaaring... Magdulot ng pagkawala ng malay Magresulta sa pagka-suffocate\'.","choice_a_en":"Smoke is extremely hot and causes immediate organ failure.","choice_a_fil":"Sobrang init ng usok at nagdudulot ito ng agarang pagkasira ng organ.","choice_b_en":"Smoke creates a vacuum, causing internal injuries.","choice_b_fil":"Lumilikha ang usok ng vacuum, na nagdudulot ng internal injuries.","choice_c_en":"Smoke contains harmful gases that lead to suffocation and unconsciousness.","choice_c_fil":"Naglalaman ang usok ng nakakapinsalang gas na humahantong sa pagka-suffocate at pagkawala ng malay.","choice_d_en":"Smoke particles are abrasive and damage lung tissue permanently.","choice_d_fil":"Ang mga particle ng usok ay abrasive at permanenteng sumisira sa tissue ng baga."},{"number":17,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which of these is a direct danger caused by smoke during a fire?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga ito ang direktang panganib na dulot ng usok sa panahon ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states smoke contains harmful gases that can \'Reduce visibility\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na ang usok ay naglalaman ng nakakapinsalang gas na maaaring \'Magpababa ng visibility (kakayahang makakita)\'.","choice_a_en":"Increased air pressure","choice_a_fil":"Pagtaas ng presyon ng hangin","choice_b_en":"Reduced visibility","choice_b_fil":"Pagbaba ng visibility (kakayahang makakita)","choice_c_en":"Lower ambient temperature","choice_c_fil":"Mas mababang temperatura ng kapaligiran","choice_d_en":"Enhanced structural integrity","choice_d_fil":"Pinahusay na structural integrity"},{"number":18,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What action should individuals take during evacuation to avoid smoke?","question_fil":"Anong aksyon ang dapat gawin ng mga indibidwal sa panahon ng paglikas upang maiwasan ang usok?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises: \'During evacuation: Stay low to avoid smoke.\'","explanation_fil":"Ipinapayo ng aralin: \'Sa panahon ng paglikas: Manatiling nakabababa upang maiwasan ang usok.\'","choice_a_en":"Stand upright to get a better view of exits.","choice_a_fil":"Tumayo nang tuwid upang mas makita ang mga labasan.","choice_b_en":"Stay low to avoid smoke.","choice_b_fil":"Manatiling nakabababa upang maiwasan ang usok.","choice_c_en":"Run quickly through the smoke to safety.","choice_c_fil":"Tumakbo nang mabilis sa usok patungo sa kaligtasan.","choice_d_en":"Hold your breath until you are out of the building.","choice_d_fil":"Pigilin ang hininga hanggang makalabas ng gusali."},{"number":19,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"According to the key takeaways, what is crucial for saving lives during a fire emergency?","question_fil":"Ayon sa mahahalagang aral, ano ang mahalaga para sa pagliligtas ng buhay sa panahon ng emergency sa sunog?","explanation_en":"One of the \'Key Takeaways\' is: \'Early detection and quick response save lives\'.","explanation_fil":"Isa sa \'Mahahalagang Aral\' ay: \'Ang maagang pagtukoy at mabilis na pagtugon ay nagliligtas ng buhay\'.","choice_a_en":"Waiting for professional firefighters to arrive.","choice_a_fil":"Paghihintay sa pagdating ng mga propesyonal na bumbero.","choice_b_en":"Early detection and quick response.","choice_b_fil":"Maagang pagtukoy at mabilis na pagtugon.","choice_c_en":"Having extensive knowledge of building architecture.","choice_c_fil":"Pagkakaroon ng malawak na kaalaman sa arkitektura ng gusali.","choice_d_en":"Prioritizing property over human life.","choice_d_fil":"Pagbibigay prayoridad sa ari-arian kaysa sa buhay ng tao."},{"number":20,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"How does the lesson describe the speed at which fires spread when not controlled?","question_fil":"Paano inilalarawan ng aralin ang bilis ng pagkalat ng sunog kapag hindi ito nakontrol?","explanation_en":"One of the \'Key Takeaways\' is: \'Fires spread rapidly when not controlled\'.","explanation_fil":"Isa sa \'Mahahalagang Aral\' ay: \'Mabilis kumalat ang sunog kapag hindi ito nakontrol\'.","choice_a_en":"Slowly and predictably","choice_a_fil":"Mabagal at mahuhulaan","choice_b_en":"Gradually and steadily","choice_b_fil":"Unti-unti at matatag","choice_c_en":"Rapidly and extensively","choice_c_fil":"Mabilis at malawakan","choice_d_en":"Minimally, only affecting localized areas","choice_d_fil":"Minimal, nakakaapekto lamang sa mga lokal na lugar"}]', 'en', '{"en":{"status":"published","outdated":false,"published_at":"2026-07-16T18:34:09+08:00"},"fil":{"status":"draft","outdated":false,"translated_at":"2026-07-16T18:32:49+08:00"}}', 'AI Generated', 2, 3, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-16 10:34:09', 3, 3, '2026-07-16 10:32:49', '2026-07-16 10:32:14', '2026-07-16 10:34:09'),
	(4, 4, 1, 'published', '[{"number":1,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"According to the lesson, what is the very first step to take during a fire emergency?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang pinakaunang hakbang na dapat gawin sa panahon ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'1. Stay Calm Avoid panic. Think clearly and act quickly.\' as the first step during a fire emergency.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin ang \'1. Manatiling Kalmado. Iwasan ang pagkabahala. Mag-isip nang malinaw at kumilos nang mabilis.\' bilang unang hakbang sa panahon ng sunog.","choice_a_en":"Call Emergency Responders","choice_a_fil":"Tumawag sa mga Emergency Responder","choice_b_en":"Activate the Fire Alarm","choice_b_fil":"Paganahin ang Fire Alarm","choice_c_en":"Stay Calm","choice_c_fil":"Manatiling Kalmado","choice_d_en":"Evacuate Immediately","choice_d_fil":"Lumikas Kaagad"},{"number":2,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What common mistake should always be avoided when evacuating a building during a fire emergency?","question_fil":"Anong karaniwang pagkakamali ang dapat palaging iwasan kapag lumilikas mula sa isang gusali sa panahon ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson explicitly states under \'Evacuate Immediately\' and \'Common Mistakes During Fire Emergencies\' to \'Do not use elevators\' and \'Using elevators\'.","explanation_fil":"Malinaw na nakasaad sa aralin sa ilalim ng \'Lumikas Kaagad\' at \'Mga Karaniwang Pagkakamali sa Panahon ng Sunog\' na \'Huwag gumamit ng mga elevator\' at \'Paggamit ng mga elevator\'.","choice_a_en":"Following designated evacuation routes","choice_a_fil":"Pagsunod sa itinalagang ruta ng paglikas","choice_b_en":"Using elevators","choice_b_fil":"Paggamit ng mga elevator","choice_c_en":"Assisting persons with disabilities","choice_c_fil":"Pagtulong sa mga taong may kapansanan","choice_d_en":"Proceeding to the assembly area","choice_d_fil":"Pagpunta sa itinalagang lugar ng pagtitipon (assembly area)"},{"number":3,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which of the following is crucial information to provide when calling emergency responders, according to the lesson?","question_fil":"Alin sa sumusunod ang mahalagang impormasyon na dapat ibigay kapag tumatawag sa mga emergency responder, ayon sa aralin?","explanation_en":"The \'Call Emergency Responders\' section states to provide \'Exact location Nature of the fire Number of people involved Known hazards\'.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa seksyong \'Tumawag sa mga Emergency Responder\' na ibigay ang \'Eksaktong lokasyon Uri ng sunog Bilang ng mga taong apektado Kilalang panganib\'.","choice_a_en":"Your full name and contact number","choice_a_fil":"Ang iyong buong pangalan at numero ng kontak","choice_b_en":"Exact location, nature of the fire, number of people involved, and known hazards","choice_b_fil":"Eksaktong lokasyon, uri ng sunog, bilang ng mga taong apektado, at mga kilalang panganib","choice_c_en":"The estimated property damage","choice_c_fil":"Ang tinatayang pinsala sa ari-arian","choice_d_en":"The names of all occupants","choice_d_fil":"Ang mga pangalan ng lahat ng nakatira\\/sumasakop"},{"number":4,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What is the correct action to take if you encounter smoke during evacuation?","question_fil":"Ano ang tamang gawin kung makasalubong ka ng usok habang lumilikas?","explanation_en":"The section \'If You Encounter Smoke\' instructs to \'Stay low. Crawl if necessary. Cover your nose and mouth.\'","explanation_fil":"Ang seksyong \'Kung Makasalubong ng Usok\' ay nagtuturo na \'Manatiling nakayuko. Gumapang kung kinakailangan. Takpan ang iyong ilong at bibig\'.","choice_a_en":"Run through the smoke as quickly as possible","choice_a_fil":"Tumakbo sa usok nang mabilis hangga\'t maaari","choice_b_en":"Stand upright and cover your mouth with your hand","choice_b_fil":"Tumayo nang tuwid at takpan ang bibig gamit ang kamay","choice_c_en":"Stay low and crawl if necessary, covering your nose and mouth","choice_c_fil":"Manatiling nakayuko at gumapang kung kinakailangan, tinatakpan ang ilong at bibig","choice_d_en":"Open any door to check for a clearer path","choice_d_fil":"Buksan ang anumang pinto upang tingnan kung may mas malinaw na daan"},{"number":5,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Why is it important to remain at the designated assembly area until authorities declare the area safe?","question_fil":"Bakit mahalagang manatili sa itinalagang lugar ng pagtitipon (assembly area) hanggang ideklara ng mga awtoridad na ligtas ang lugar?","explanation_en":"The lesson states \'Remain there until authorities declare the area safe. Never return inside the building without official permission.\' This implies accounting for safety and preventing unsafe re-entry.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na \'Manatili doon hanggang ideklara ng mga awtoridad na ligtas ang lugar. Huwag kailanman bumalik sa loob ng gusali nang walang opisyal na pahintulot.\' Ipinapahiwatig nito ang pagtiyak sa kaligtasan at pagpigil sa hindi ligtas na pagpasok muli.","choice_a_en":"To wait for instructions on how to return for personal belongings","choice_a_fil":"Upang maghintay ng mga tagubilin kung paano makabalik para sa mga personal na gamit","choice_b_en":"To ensure everyone is accounted for and prevent re-entry into an unsafe building","choice_b_fil":"Upang matiyak na lahat ay naitala at maiwasan ang pagpasok muli sa isang hindi ligtas na gusali","choice_c_en":"To assist in putting out the fire with emergency responders","choice_c_fil":"Upang tumulong sa pagpatay ng sunog kasama ang mga emergency responder","choice_d_en":"To provide a clear path for fire trucks to access the building","choice_d_fil":"Upang magbigay ng malinaw na daan para sa mga trak ng bumbero upang makalapit sa gusali"},{"number":6,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"After evacuating a building during a fire, where should occupants proceed?","question_fil":"Pagkatapos lumikas mula sa isang gusali sa panahon ng sunog, saan dapat magtungo ang mga nakatira\\/sumasakop?","explanation_en":"The \'Steps During a Fire Emergency\' section states \'5. Proceed to the Assembly Area Move directly to the designated assembly point.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa seksyong \'Mga Hakbang sa Panahon ng Sunog\' ang \'5. Magtungo sa Lugar ng Pagtitipon (Assembly Area) Diretsong pumunta sa itinalagang lugar ng pagtitipon\'.","choice_a_en":"Back inside to check for others","choice_a_fil":"Pabalik sa loob upang tingnan ang iba","choice_b_en":"To the nearest exit and wait there","choice_b_fil":"Sa pinakamalapit na labasan at maghintay doon","choice_c_en":"To the designated assembly area","choice_c_fil":"Sa itinalagang lugar ng pagtitipon (assembly area)","choice_d_en":"To a safe distance across the street","choice_d_fil":"Sa isang ligtas na distansya sa kabilang kalsada"},{"number":7,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"If your clothes catch fire, what is the immediate and correct sequence of actions to take?","question_fil":"Kung masunog ang iyong damit, ano ang agarang at tamang pagkakasunod-sunod ng mga hakbang na dapat gawin?","explanation_en":"The section \'If Your Clothes Catch Fire\' advises to \'Remember: STOP \\u2013 DROP \\u2013 ROLL\'.","explanation_fil":"Ang seksyong \'Kung Masunog ang Iyong Damit\' ay nagpapayo na \'Tandaan: HUMINTO \\u2013 DUMAPA \\u2013 GUMULONG (STOP \\u2013 DROP \\u2013 ROLL)\'.","choice_a_en":"Run to find water, then roll on the ground","choice_a_fil":"Tumakbo upang maghanap ng tubig, pagkatapos ay gumulong sa lupa","choice_b_en":"STOP \\u2013 DROP \\u2013 ROLL","choice_b_fil":"HUMINTO \\u2013 DUMAPA \\u2013 GUMULONG (STOP \\u2013 DROP \\u2013 ROLL)","choice_c_en":"Fan the flames to put them out, then seek help","choice_c_fil":"Paypayan ang apoy upang patayin, pagkatapos ay humingi ng tulong","choice_d_en":"Shout for help while remaining still","choice_d_fil":"Sumigaw ng tulong habang nananatiling nakatayo"},{"number":8,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is the primary purpose of activating the fire alarm immediately during a fire incident?","question_fil":"Ano ang pangunahing layunin ng agarang pagpapaandar ng fire alarm sa panahon ng insidente ng sunog?","explanation_en":"Under \'Activate the Fire Alarm\', the lesson states: \'Notify everyone in the building immediately. Early warning allows occupants to evacuate safely.\'","explanation_fil":"Sa ilalim ng \'Paganahin ang Fire Alarm\', nakasaad sa aralin: \'Agad ipaalam sa lahat ng nasa gusali. Ang maagang babala ay nagpapahintulot sa mga nakatira\\/sumasakop na lumikas nang ligtas\'.","choice_a_en":"To alert emergency responders to the exact location","choice_a_fil":"Upang alertuhin ang mga emergency responder sa eksaktong lokasyon","choice_b_en":"To notify everyone in the building and allow for safe evacuation","choice_b_fil":"Upang ipaalam sa lahat ng nasa gusali at payagan ang ligtas na paglikas","choice_c_en":"To confirm the nature of the fire before taking further action","choice_c_fil":"Upang kumpirmahin ang uri ng sunog bago gumawa ng karagdagang aksyon","choice_d_en":"To guide people towards the nearest emergency exit","choice_d_fil":"Upang gabayan ang mga tao patungo sa pinakamalapit na emergency exit"},{"number":9,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What does the lesson emphasize regarding basic emergency communication during fire incidents?","question_fil":"Ano ang binibigyang-diin ng aralin tungkol sa pangunahing komunikasyon sa emergency sa panahon ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The \'Emergency Communication\' section states: \'Always provide clear and accurate information when reporting an emergency.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa seksyong \'Komunikasyon sa Emergency\': \'Palaging magbigay ng malinaw at tumpak na impormasyon kapag nag-uulat ng emergency\'.","choice_a_en":"It should be detailed, including personal opinions","choice_a_fil":"Dapat itong detalyado, kasama ang personal na opinyon","choice_b_en":"It should be clear and accurate information","choice_b_fil":"Dapat itong malinaw at tumpak na impormasyon","choice_c_en":"It should only be done by designated safety officers","choice_c_fil":"Dapat itong gawin lamang ng mga itinalagang safety officer","choice_d_en":"It should be delivered as quickly as possible, even if incomplete","choice_d_fil":"Dapat itong ibigay nang mabilis hangga\'t maaari, kahit hindi kumpleto"},{"number":10,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"When evacuating, if possible, what should you do with doors behind you?","question_fil":"Kapag lumilikas, kung maaari, ano ang dapat mong gawin sa mga pinto sa likuran mo?","explanation_en":"The \'Basic Evacuation Guidelines\' state: \'Close doors behind you if possible.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa \'Pangunahing Gabay sa Paglikas\': \'Isara ang mga pinto sa likuran mo kung maaari\'.","choice_a_en":"Leave them wide open to allow for easy re-entry","choice_a_fil":"Iwanan itong bukas upang madaling makapasok muli","choice_b_en":"Close them behind you","choice_b_fil":"Isara ang mga ito sa likuran mo","choice_c_en":"Block them with furniture to prevent fire spread","choice_c_fil":"Harangan ang mga ito gamit ang kasangkapan upang maiwasan ang pagkalat ng apoy","choice_d_en":"Lock them to secure the area","choice_d_fil":"Kandanduhan ang mga ito upang ma-secure ang lugar"},{"number":11,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What is explicitly stated as something never to do regarding emergency exits?","question_fil":"Ano ang malinaw na nakasaad bilang isang bagay na hindi dapat gawin tungkol sa mga emergency exit?","explanation_en":"The \'Basic Evacuation Guidelines\' include: \'Never block emergency exits.\'","explanation_fil":"Kasama sa \'Pangunahing Gabay sa Paglikas\' ang: \'Huwag kailanman harangan ang mga emergency exit\'.","choice_a_en":"Follow evacuation signs towards them","choice_a_fil":"Sundin ang mga karatula ng paglikas patungo sa mga ito","choice_b_en":"Use them only when instructed by safety officers","choice_b_fil":"Gamitin lamang ang mga ito kapag inutusan ng mga safety officer","choice_c_en":"Block emergency exits","choice_c_fil":"Harangan ang mga emergency exit","choice_d_en":"Check if they are clear before using them","choice_d_fil":"Suriin kung malinaw ang mga ito bago gamitin"},{"number":12,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"You have successfully evacuated the building during a fire and are at the assembly area. What is the correct next step based on the lesson?","question_fil":"Matagumpay kang nakalikas mula sa gusali sa panahon ng sunog at nasa lugar ka na ng pagtitipon (assembly area). Ano ang tamang susunod na hakbang batay sa aralin?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises to \'Remain there until authorities declare the area safe. Never return inside the building without official permission.\'","explanation_fil":"Payo ng aralin na \'Manatili doon hanggang ideklara ng mga awtoridad na ligtas ang lugar. Huwag kailanman bumalik sa loob ng gusali nang walang opisyal na pahintulot\'.","choice_a_en":"Go back inside the building to check if the fire is out","choice_a_fil":"Bumalik sa loob ng gusali upang tingnan kung patay na ang apoy","choice_b_en":"Immediately call your family to inform them you are safe","choice_b_fil":"Agad na tawagan ang iyong pamilya upang ipaalam na ligtas ka","choice_c_en":"Remain at the assembly area until authorities declare it safe","choice_c_fil":"Manatili sa lugar ng pagtitipon (assembly area) hanggang ideklara ng mga awtoridad na ligtas ito","choice_d_en":"Start helping emergency responders by directing traffic","choice_d_fil":"Magsimulang tumulong sa mga emergency responder sa pagdidirekta ng trapiko"},{"number":13,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which group of people should be assisted first during evacuation, if possible?","question_fil":"Aling grupo ng mga tao ang dapat tulungan muna sa panahon ng paglikas, kung maaari?","explanation_en":"Under \'Evacuate Immediately\', the lesson states: \'Assist children, elderly persons, and persons with disabilities whenever possible.\'","explanation_fil":"Sa ilalim ng \'Lumikas Kaagad\', nakasaad sa aralin: \'Tulungan ang mga bata, matatanda, at mga taong may kapansanan hangga\'t maaari\'.","choice_a_en":"Only your assigned group members","choice_a_fil":"Tanging ang mga miyembro lamang ng iyong itinalagang grupo","choice_b_en":"Children, elderly persons, and persons with disabilities","choice_b_fil":"Mga bata, matatanda, at mga taong may kapansanan","choice_c_en":"Able-bodied adults who are panicking","choice_c_fil":"Mga matatandang may kakayahang kumilos na nagpa-panic","choice_d_en":"Those carrying valuable personal belongings","choice_d_fil":"Ang mga nagdadala ng mahahalagang personal na gamit"},{"number":14,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Why is it crucial to avoid running during evacuation?","question_fil":"Bakit mahalagang iwasan ang pagtakbo sa panahon ng paglikas?","explanation_en":"The \'Basic Evacuation Guidelines\' state \'Walk calmly. Do not run.\' and \'Running during evacuation\' is listed as a common mistake. This is to avoid panic, confusion, and potential injuries.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa \'Pangunahing Gabay sa Paglikas\' na \'Maglakad nang mahinahon. Huwag tumakbo.\' at ang \'Pagtakbo sa panahon ng paglikas\' ay nakalista bilang isang karaniwang pagkakamali. Ito ay upang maiwasan ang pagkabahala, pagkalito, at posibleng pinsala.","choice_a_en":"It conserves energy for a longer evacuation.","choice_a_fil":"Nakakatipid ito ng enerhiya para sa mas mahabang paglikas.","choice_b_en":"It helps maintain order and prevents injuries.","choice_b_fil":"Nakakatulong ito upang mapanatili ang kaayusan at maiwasan ang mga pinsala.","choice_c_en":"It allows for a more thorough search for fire sources.","choice_c_fil":"Pinapayagan nito ang mas masusing paghahanap ng pinagmulan ng apoy.","choice_d_en":"It ensures you stay with your assigned group.","choice_d_fil":"Tinitiyak nito na mananatili ka sa iyong itinalagang grupo."},{"number":15,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"A","question_en":"What should you avoid doing with hot doors when encountering smoke?","question_fil":"Ano ang dapat mong iwasan gawin sa mga mainit na pinto kapag nakasalubong ng usok?","explanation_en":"The section \'If You Encounter Smoke\' instructs to \'Avoid opening hot doors.\'","explanation_fil":"Ang seksyong \'Kung Makasalubong ng Usok\' ay nagtuturo na \'Iwasan ang pagbubukas ng mga mainit na pinto\'.","choice_a_en":"Opening them","choice_a_fil":"Pagbubukas ng mga ito","choice_b_en":"Touching them","choice_b_fil":"Paghipo sa mga ito","choice_c_en":"Pushing them open slowly","choice_c_fil":"Marahang pagtulak upang buksan ang mga ito","choice_d_en":"Checking their temperature","choice_d_fil":"Pagsuri sa kanilang temperatura"},{"number":16,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is the primary purpose of knowing designated evacuation routes and assembly areas?","question_fil":"Ano ang pangunahing layunin ng pag-alam sa mga itinalagang ruta ng paglikas at mga lugar ng pagtitipon (assembly areas)?","explanation_en":"The lesson overview mentions the importance of \'safely evacuating the area\' and \'designated evacuation routes, assembly areas\' to \'identify safe evacuation procedures\' and \'recognize emergency exits and assembly areas\', contributing to a systematic and safe process.","explanation_fil":"Binanggit ng pangkalahatang-ideya ng aralin ang kahalagahan ng \'ligtas na paglikas sa lugar\' at \'mga itinalagang ruta ng paglikas, mga lugar ng pagtitipon (assembly areas)\' upang \'matukoy ang ligtas na pamamaraan ng paglikas\' at \'makilala ang mga emergency exit at lugar ng pagtitipon\', na nag-aambag sa isang sistematiko at ligtas na proseso.","choice_a_en":"To help emergency responders navigate the building","choice_a_fil":"Upang matulungan ang mga emergency responder na makakilos sa gusali","choice_b_en":"To ensure a systematic and safe evacuation process","choice_b_fil":"Upang matiyak ang isang sistematiko at ligtas na proseso ng paglikas","choice_c_en":"To practice fire drills regularly","choice_c_fil":"Upang regular na magsanay ng fire drills","choice_d_en":"To identify potential fire hazards","choice_d_fil":"Upang matukoy ang mga posibleng panganib sa sunog"},{"number":17,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"According to the lesson, what is a significant risk caused by panic, confusion, and delayed decision-making during a fire emergency?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang isang malaking panganib na dulot ng pagkabahala (panic), pagkalito, at naantalang paggawa ng desisyon sa panahon ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The \'Lesson Overview\' states: \'Panic, confusion, and delayed decision-making can place lives at greater risk.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa \'Pangkalahatang-ideya ng Aralin\': \'Ang pagkabahala (panic), pagkalito, at naantalang paggawa ng desisyon ay maaaring maglagay sa mga buhay sa mas malaking panganib\'.","choice_a_en":"Increased property damage","choice_a_fil":"Pagtaas ng pinsala sa ari-arian","choice_b_en":"Longer response times from emergency services","choice_b_fil":"Mas matagal na oras ng pagtugon mula sa mga serbisyong pang-emergency","choice_c_en":"Placing lives at greater risk","choice_c_fil":"Paglalagay ng mga buhay sa mas malaking panganib","choice_d_en":"Miscommunication among safety officers","choice_d_fil":"Pagkakamali sa komunikasyon sa pagitan ng mga safety officer"},{"number":18,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is one of the key takeaways for reporting emergencies?","question_fil":"Ano ang isa sa mga pangunahing aral para sa pag-uulat ng mga emergency?","explanation_en":"Under \'Key Takeaways\', the lesson states: \'Report emergencies clearly and accurately.\'","explanation_fil":"Sa ilalim ng \'Mga Pangunahing Aral\', nakasaad sa aralin: \'Mag-ulat ng mga emergency nang malinaw at tumpak\'.","choice_a_en":"Report only after confirming the fire source.","choice_a_fil":"Mag-ulat lamang pagkatapos kumpirmahin ang pinagmulan ng apoy.","choice_b_en":"Report emergencies clearly and accurately.","choice_b_fil":"Mag-ulat ng mga emergency nang malinaw at tumpak.","choice_c_en":"Report only when instructed by a safety officer.","choice_c_fil":"Mag-ulat lamang kapag inutusan ng isang safety officer.","choice_d_en":"Report via social media for wider dissemination.","choice_d_fil":"Mag-ulat sa pamamagitan ng social media para sa mas malawak na pagpapakalat."},{"number":19,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is listed as a common mistake during fire emergencies?","question_fil":"Alin sa sumusunod ang nakalista bilang isang karaniwang pagkakamali sa panahon ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The \'Common Mistakes During Fire Emergencies\' section explicitly lists: \'Ignoring evacuation alarms.\'","explanation_fil":"Malinaw na nakalista sa seksyong \'Mga Karaniwang Pagkakamali sa Panahon ng Sunog\': \'Pagwawalang-bahala sa mga alarm ng paglikas\'.","choice_a_en":"Staying low when encountering smoke","choice_a_fil":"Manatiling nakayuko kapag nakasalubong ng usok","choice_b_en":"Reporting emergencies clearly","choice_b_fil":"Pag-uulat ng mga emergency nang malinaw","choice_c_en":"Ignoring evacuation alarms","choice_c_fil":"Pagwawalang-bahala sa mga alarm ng paglikas","choice_d_en":"Assisting children during evacuation","choice_d_fil":"Pagtulong sa mga bata sa panahon ng paglikas"},{"number":20,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What should occupants never do without official permission after evacuating to an assembly area?","question_fil":"Ano ang hindi dapat gawin ng mga nakatira\\/sumasakop nang walang opisyal na pahintulot pagkatapos lumikas patungo sa isang lugar ng pagtitipon (assembly area)?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'Proceed to the Assembly Area ... Never return inside the building without official permission.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin: \'Magtungo sa Lugar ng Pagtitipon (Assembly Area) ... Huwag kailanman bumalik sa loob ng gusali nang walang opisyal na pahintulot\'.","choice_a_en":"Call their families","choice_a_fil":"Tawagan ang kanilang mga pamilya","choice_b_en":"Return inside the building","choice_b_fil":"Bumalik sa loob ng gusali","choice_c_en":"Discuss the incident with others","choice_c_fil":"Talakayin ang insidente sa iba","choice_d_en":"Provide first aid to injured persons","choice_d_fil":"Magbigay ng first aid sa mga nasugatan"}]', 'en', '{"en":{"status":"published","outdated":false,"published_at":"2026-07-16T23:37:23+08:00"},"fil":{"status":"draft","outdated":false,"translated_at":"2026-07-16T20:15:51+08:00"}}', 'AI Generated', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-16 15:37:23', 3, 3, '2026-07-16 12:15:51', '2026-07-16 12:15:08', '2026-07-16 15:37:23'),
	(5, 2, 1, 'published', '[{"number":1,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is identified as one of the leading causes of fire incidents?","question_fil":"Ano ang kinikilala bilang isa sa mga pangunahing sanhi ng insidente ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson explicitly states, \'Electrical faults are one of the leading causes of fire incidents.\'","explanation_fil":"Malinaw na nakasaad sa aralin na, \'Ang mga depekto sa kuryente ay isa sa mga pangunahing sanhi ng insidente ng sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"Leaving cooking unattended","choice_a_fil":"Pag-iwan ng niluluto nang walang bantay","choice_b_en":"Electrical faults","choice_b_fil":"Mga depekto sa kuryente","choice_c_en":"Storing flammable materials improperly","choice_c_fil":"Maling pagtatago ng mga materyal na madaling masunog","choice_d_en":"Obstructed fire exits","choice_d_fil":"Nakaharang na mga fire exit"},{"number":2,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is the primary goal of fire prevention according to the lesson?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang pangunahing layunin ng pag-iwas sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The overview states, \'Fire prevention is the practice of identifying and eliminating potential fire hazards before they cause damage or injury.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa pangkalahatang-ideya na, \'Ang pag-iwas sa sunog ay ang pagtukoy at pag-aalis ng mga potensyal na panganib sa sunog bago pa man magdulot ng pinsala o sakuna ang mga ito.\'","choice_a_en":"To practice emergency response procedures","choice_a_fil":"Upang magsagawa ng mga pamamaraan ng pagtugon sa emerhensiya","choice_b_en":"To identify and eliminate potential fire hazards before they cause damage","choice_b_fil":"Upang matukoy at maalis ang mga potensyal na panganib sa sunog bago pa man magdulot ng pinsala ang mga ito","choice_c_en":"To ensure fire extinguishers are always accessible","choice_c_fil":"Upang matiyak na laging madaling maabot ang mga fire extinguisher","choice_d_en":"To train employees on emergency response procedures","choice_d_fil":"Upang sanayin ang mga empleyado sa mga pamamaraan ng pagtugon sa emerhensiya"},{"number":3,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is a best practice for safe cooking?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang pinakamahusay na kasanayan para sa ligtas na pagluluto?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises, \'Keep children away from cooking areas\' as a best practice for safe cooking.","explanation_fil":"Pinapayuhan ng aralin na, \'Ilayo ang mga bata sa lugar ng pagluluto\' bilang isang pinakamahusay na kasanayan para sa ligtas na pagluluto.","choice_a_en":"Leave cooking unattended for short periods","choice_a_fil":"Iwanan ang niluluto nang walang bantay sa maikling panahon","choice_b_en":"Store flammable materials near the stove for convenience","choice_b_fil":"Itago ang mga madaling masunog na materyal malapit sa kalan para sa kaginhawaan","choice_c_en":"Keep children away from cooking areas","choice_c_fil":"Ilayo ang mga bata sa lugar ng pagluluto","choice_d_en":"Use damaged extension cords for kitchen appliances","choice_d_fil":"Gumamit ng sirang extension cord para sa mga gamit sa kusina"},{"number":4,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Where should flammable materials like gasoline and paint thinner ideally be stored?","question_fil":"Saan mainam na itago ang mga madaling masunog na materyal tulad ng gasolina at paint thinner?","explanation_en":"The lesson specifies, \'Store in cool, dry, and well-ventilated areas\' for flammable materials.","explanation_fil":"Tinukoy ng aralin na, \'Itago sa malamig, tuyo, at mahusay na bentiladong lugar\' ang mga madaling masunog na materyal.","choice_a_en":"Inside buildings in excessive amounts","choice_a_fil":"Sa loob ng mga gusali sa sobrang dami","choice_b_en":"Near open flames for quick access","choice_b_fil":"Malapit sa bukas na apoy para sa mabilis na pagkuha","choice_c_en":"In cool, dry, and well-ventilated areas","choice_c_fil":"Sa malamig, tuyo, at mahusay na bentiladong lugar","choice_d_en":"Under the stove in the kitchen","choice_d_fil":"Sa ilalim ng kalan sa kusina"},{"number":5,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"How does good housekeeping contribute to fire prevention?","question_fil":"Paano nakakatulong ang maayos na pangangalaga sa bahay (good housekeeping) sa pag-iwas sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'A clean and organized environment reduces fire hazards\' under Good Housekeeping.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin, sa ilalim ng \'Good Housekeeping,\' na \'Ang malinis at organisadong kapaligiran ay nakakabawas ng mga panganib sa sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"By increasing the amount of combustible materials","choice_a_fil":"Sa pamamagitan ng pagdaragdag ng dami ng mga materyal na madaling masunog","choice_b_en":"By keeping exits and hallways obstructed","choice_b_fil":"Sa pamamagitan ng pagharang sa mga labasan at pasilyo","choice_c_en":"By reducing fire hazards through a clean and organized environment","choice_c_fil":"Sa pamamagitan ng pagbabawas ng mga panganib sa sunog sa pamamagitan ng malinis at organisadong kapaligiran","choice_d_en":"By storing papers and cardboard near heat sources","choice_d_fil":"Sa pamamagitan ng pagtatago ng mga papel at karton malapit sa mga pinagmumulan ng init"},{"number":6,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"According to the lesson, what is an essential practice for employees regarding workplace fire safety?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang mahalagang kasanayan para sa mga empleyado hinggil sa kaligtasan sa sunog sa lugar ng trabaho?","explanation_en":"\'Participate in fire drills\' is listed as a best practice for workplace fire safety.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad ang \'Makilahok sa mga fire drill\' bilang isang pinakamahusay na kasanayan para sa kaligtasan sa sunog sa lugar ng trabaho.","choice_a_en":"Ignoring the location of fire extinguishers","choice_a_fil":"Hindi pagpansin sa lokasyon ng mga fire extinguisher","choice_b_en":"Participating in fire drills","choice_b_fil":"Pakikilahok sa mga fire drill","choice_c_en":"Storing personal items in emergency exits","choice_c_fil":"Pagtatago ng mga personal na gamit sa mga emergency exit","choice_d_en":"Waiting for a fire incident before reporting hazards","choice_d_fil":"Paghihintay ng insidente ng sunog bago iulat ang mga panganib"},{"number":7,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What should homeowners and family members do regarding smoke alarms?","question_fil":"Ano ang dapat gawin ng mga may-ari ng bahay at miyembro ng pamilya tungkol sa mga smoke alarm?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises homeowners to \'Install smoke alarms\' and \'Test smoke alarms regularly.\'","explanation_fil":"Pinapayuhan ng aralin ang mga may-ari ng bahay na \'Mag-install ng mga smoke alarm\' at \'Regular na subukan ang mga smoke alarm.\'","choice_a_en":"Install them only in the kitchen","choice_a_fil":"I-install lang ang mga ito sa kusina","choice_b_en":"Turn them off during cooking to avoid false alarms","choice_b_fil":"Patayin ang mga ito habang nagluluto upang maiwasan ang mga false alarm","choice_c_en":"Install and test them regularly","choice_c_fil":"I-install at regular na subukan ang mga ito","choice_d_en":"Rely on neighbors to install smoke alarms","choice_d_fil":"Umasa sa mga kapitbahay na mag-install ng mga smoke alarm"},{"number":8,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is a key responsibility for government facilities regarding fire safety?","question_fil":"Ano ang pangunahing responsibilidad ng mga pasilidad ng gobyerno hinggil sa kaligtasan sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states that government facilities should \'Conduct regular fire safety inspections.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na ang mga pasilidad ng gobyerno ay dapat \'Magsagawa ng regular na inspeksyon sa kaligtasan sa sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"To block evacuation routes for security reasons","choice_a_fil":"Upang harangan ang mga ruta ng paglikas para sa mga kadahilanang pangseguridad","choice_b_en":"To conduct regular fire safety inspections","choice_b_fil":"Upang magsagawa ng regular na inspeksyon sa kaligtasan sa sunog","choice_c_en":"To remove emergency exit signs","choice_c_fil":"Upang alisin ang mga karatula ng emergency exit","choice_d_en":"To wait for external agencies to train employees","choice_d_fil":"Upang hintayin ang mga panlabas na ahensya na magsanay sa mga empleyado"},{"number":9,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which action is considered a best practice for electrical safety?","question_fil":"Aling aksyon ang itinuturing na pinakamahusay na kasanayan para sa kaligtasan sa kuryente?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises, \'Replace damaged electrical cords immediately\' as a best practice for electrical safety.","explanation_fil":"Pinapayuhan ng aralin na, \'Agarang palitan ang mga sirang electrical cord\' bilang isang pinakamahusay na kasanayan para sa kaligtasan sa kuryente.","choice_a_en":"Overloading electrical outlets with multiple devices","choice_a_fil":"Pag-overload ng mga electrical outlet ng maraming aparato","choice_b_en":"Using damaged extension cords for convenience","choice_b_fil":"Paggamit ng sirang extension cord para sa kaginhawaan","choice_c_en":"Replacing damaged electrical cords immediately","choice_c_fil":"Agarang palitan ang mga sirang electrical cord","choice_d_en":"Attempting to repair faulty wiring without qualification","choice_d_fil":"Pagsisikap na ayusin ang sirang wiring nang walang kwalipikasyon"},{"number":10,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Why is it recommended to keep a fire extinguisher nearby while cooking?","question_fil":"Bakit inirerekomenda na magkaroon ng fire extinguisher malapit habang nagluluto?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Keep a fire extinguisher nearby\' as a best practice for safe cooking, implying its use for cooking fires.","explanation_fil":"Inililista ng aralin ang \'Panatilihing malapit ang fire extinguisher\' bilang isang pinakamahusay na kasanayan para sa ligtas na pagluluto, na nagpapahiwatig ng paggamit nito para sa mga sunog sa pagluluto.","choice_a_en":"To store it in a cool, dry place","choice_a_fil":"Upang itago ito sa malamig at tuyong lugar","choice_b_en":"To use it in case of a cooking fire","choice_b_fil":"Upang gamitin ito sa kaso ng sunog sa pagluluto","choice_c_en":"To keep children away from it","choice_c_fil":"Upang ilayo ang mga bata rito","choice_d_en":"To comply with general household regulations unrelated to fires","choice_d_fil":"Upang sumunod sa pangkalahatang regulasyon ng sambahayan na walang kinalaman sa sunog"},{"number":11,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is explicitly listed as a flammable material in the lesson content?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang malinaw na nakalista bilang madaling masunog na materyal sa nilalaman ng aralin?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'LPG cylinders\' as an example of a flammable material.","explanation_fil":"Inililista ng aralin ang \'LPG cylinders\' bilang isang halimbawa ng madaling masunog na materyal.","choice_a_en":"Water","choice_a_fil":"Tubig","choice_b_en":"Soil","choice_b_fil":"Lupa","choice_c_en":"LPG cylinders","choice_c_fil":"LPG cylinders (tangke ng LPG)","choice_d_en":"Sand","choice_d_fil":"Buhangin"},{"number":12,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is a best practice for good housekeeping regarding exits and hallways?","question_fil":"Ano ang pinakamahusay na kasanayan para sa maayos na pangangalaga sa bahay (good housekeeping) hinggil sa mga labasan at pasilyo?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Keep exits and hallways free from obstructions\' under Good Housekeeping.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin, sa ilalim ng \'Good Housekeeping,\' na \'Panatilihing walang nakaharang ang mga labasan at pasilyo.\'","choice_a_en":"Use them for storing excess materials","choice_a_fil":"Gamitin ang mga ito sa pagtatago ng sobrang materyales","choice_b_en":"Keep them free from obstructions","choice_b_fil":"Panatilihing walang nakaharang ang mga ito","choice_c_en":"Block them during non-working hours","choice_c_fil":"Harangan ang mga ito sa oras na walang trabaho","choice_d_en":"Store papers and cardboard in them","choice_d_fil":"Itago ang mga papel at karton sa mga ito"},{"number":13,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"According to the Fire Safety Checklist, what should you always check before leaving your home or workplace?","question_fil":"Ayon sa Fire Safety Checklist, ano ang dapat mong laging suriin bago umalis ng bahay o lugar ng trabaho?","explanation_en":"The checklist includes \'Electrical appliances are turned off\' as an item to check.","explanation_fil":"Kasama sa checklist ang \'Nakapatay ang mga electrical appliance\' bilang isang bagay na dapat suriin.","choice_a_en":"If the television is on","choice_a_fil":"Kung bukas ang telebisyon","choice_b_en":"If electrical appliances are turned off","choice_b_fil":"Kung nakapatay ang mga electrical appliance","choice_c_en":"If all windows are locked and secured","choice_c_fil":"Kung nakakandado at nakasara nang maayos ang lahat ng bintana","choice_d_en":"If mail has been collected from the mailbox","choice_d_fil":"Kung nakolekta na ang sulat mula sa mailbox"},{"number":14,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What is emphasized as better than emergency response in the Key Takeaways section?","question_fil":"Ano ang binibigyang-diin na mas mahusay kaysa sa pagtugon sa emerhensiya sa seksyon ng Mga Pangunahing Punto (Key Takeaways)?","explanation_en":"The Key Takeaways state, \'Prevention is always better than emergency response.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa Mga Pangunahing Punto (Key Takeaways) na, \'Ang pag-iwas ay palaging mas mahusay kaysa sa pagtugon sa emerhensiya.\'","choice_a_en":"Recovery","choice_a_fil":"Pagbawi (Recovery)","choice_b_en":"Investigation","choice_b_fil":"Imbestigasyon","choice_c_en":"Prevention","choice_c_fil":"Pag-iwas (Prevention)","choice_d_en":"Evacuation","choice_d_fil":"Paglikas (Evacuation)"},{"number":15,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Who should repair faulty wiring according to electrical safety best practices?","question_fil":"Sino ang dapat mag-ayos ng sirang wiring ayon sa pinakamahusay na kasanayan sa kaligtasan sa kuryente?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises, \'Have faulty wiring repaired by a qualified electrician.\'","explanation_fil":"Pinapayuhan ng aralin na, \'Ipinaayos ang sirang wiring sa isang kwalipikadong electrician.\'","choice_a_en":"Anyone with basic tools","choice_a_fil":"Sinuman na may pangunahing kasangkapan","choice_b_en":"The homeowner or resident","choice_b_fil":"Ang may-ari ng bahay o residente","choice_c_en":"A qualified electrician","choice_c_fil":"Isang kwalipikadong electrician","choice_d_en":"A general handyman without specific electrical certification","choice_d_fil":"Isang pangkalahatang handyman na walang partikular na sertipikasyon sa kuryente"},{"number":16,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is a recommended practice after cooking with gas?","question_fil":"Ano ang inirerekomendang kasanayan pagkatapos magluto gamit ang gas?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Turn off gas valves after cooking.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na, \'Patayin ang mga gas valve pagkatapos magluto.\'","choice_a_en":"Leave gas valves open for ventilation","choice_a_fil":"Iwanan ang mga gas valve na nakabukas para sa bentilasyon","choice_b_en":"Turn off gas valves","choice_b_fil":"Patayin ang mga gas valve","choice_c_en":"Store flammable liquids near the stove","choice_c_fil":"Itago ang mga madaling masunog na likido malapit sa kalan","choice_d_en":"Ignore the gas valves as they are self-regulating","choice_d_fil":"Huwag pansinin ang mga gas valve dahil ang mga ito ay self-regulating"},{"number":17,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is a best practice regarding storing excessive amounts of flammable materials?","question_fil":"Ano ang pinakamahusay na kasanayan hinggil sa pagtatago ng sobrang dami ng madaling masunog na materyales?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Never store excessive amounts inside buildings.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na, \'Huwag kailanman magtago ng sobrang dami sa loob ng mga gusali.\'","choice_a_en":"Store them inside buildings for convenience","choice_a_fil":"Itago ang mga ito sa loob ng mga gusali para sa kaginhawaan","choice_b_en":"Never store excessive amounts inside buildings","choice_b_fil":"Huwag kailanman magtago ng sobrang dami sa loob ng mga gusali","choice_c_en":"Store them near heat sources to prevent freezing","choice_c_fil":"Itago ang mga ito malapit sa mga pinagmumulan ng init upang maiwasan ang pagyelo","choice_d_en":"Place them in easily accessible, open containers","choice_d_fil":"Ilagay ang mga ito sa madaling maabot, bukas na lalagyan"},{"number":18,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What should employees do immediately upon identifying fire hazards in the workplace?","question_fil":"Ano ang dapat gawin ng mga empleyado agad pagkatapos matukoy ang mga panganib sa sunog sa lugar ng trabaho?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Report fire hazards immediately\' as a workplace best practice.","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na, \'Agarang iulat ang mga panganib sa sunog\' bilang isang pinakamahusay na kasanayan sa lugar ng trabaho.","choice_a_en":"Wait for a scheduled inspection","choice_a_fil":"Maghintay ng nakatakdang inspeksyon","choice_b_en":"Try to fix the hazard themselves without reporting","choice_b_fil":"Subukang ayusin ang panganib nang sila mismo nang hindi nag-uulat","choice_c_en":"Report fire hazards immediately","choice_c_fil":"Agarang iulat ang mga panganib sa sunog","choice_d_en":"Discuss it with colleagues before taking action","choice_d_fil":"Talakayin ito sa mga kasamahan bago kumilos"},{"number":19,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is recommended for families to prepare in case of a fire?","question_fil":"Ano ang inirerekomenda para sa mga pamilya na ihanda sa kaso ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises homeowners to \'Prepare a family evacuation plan.\'","explanation_fil":"Pinapayuhan ng aralin ang mga may-ari ng bahay na \'Maghanda ng plano sa paglikas ng pamilya.\'","choice_a_en":"A detailed inventory of valuables","choice_a_fil":"Isang detalyadong imbentaryo ng mga mahahalagang bagay","choice_b_en":"A family evacuation plan","choice_b_fil":"Isang plano sa paglikas ng pamilya","choice_c_en":"A list of fire department contacts only","choice_c_fil":"Isang listahan lamang ng mga kontak sa kagawaran ng bumbero","choice_d_en":"A collection of water buckets for extinguishing","choice_d_fil":"Isang koleksyon ng mga timba ng tubig para sa pagpatay ng sunog"},{"number":20,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What helps greatly reduce the likelihood of fire incidents according to the lesson summary?","question_fil":"Ano ang malaking nakakatulong upang mabawasan ang posibilidad ng insidente ng sunog ayon sa buod ng aralin?","explanation_en":"The lesson summary concludes, \'Consistent fire prevention practices help protect lives, property, and the community.\'","explanation_fil":"Tinapos ng buod ng aralin na, \'Ang pare-parehong mga kasanayan sa pag-iwas sa sunog ay nakakatulong na protektahan ang buhay, ari-arian, at ang komunidad.\'","choice_a_en":"Ignoring potential hazards","choice_a_fil":"Pagwawalang-bahala sa mga potensyal na panganib","choice_b_en":"Inconsistent fire prevention practices","choice_b_fil":"Hindi pare-parehong mga kasanayan sa pag-iwas sa sunog","choice_c_en":"Consistent fire prevention practices","choice_c_fil":"Pare-parehong mga kasanayan sa pag-iwas sa sunog","choice_d_en":"Waiting for emergency responders to act","choice_d_fil":"Paghihintay sa paggalaw ng mga emergency responder"}]', 'en', '{"en":{"status":"published","outdated":false,"published_at":"2026-07-16T23:43:42+08:00"},"fil":{"status":"draft","outdated":false,"translated_at":"2026-07-16T23:39:43+08:00"}}', 'AI Generated', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-16 15:43:42', 3, 3, '2026-07-16 15:39:43', '2026-07-16 15:39:03', '2026-07-16 15:43:42'),
	(6, 6, 1, 'published', '[{"number":1,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"According to the lesson, what is the primary purpose of fire extinguishers?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang pangunahing layunin ng mga fire extinguisher?","explanation_en":"The lesson overview states, \'Fire extinguishers are one of the most important pieces of emergency equipment used to control small fires before they become uncontrollable.\'","explanation_fil":"Ayon sa pangkalahatang-ideya ng aralin, \'Ang mga fire extinguisher ay isa sa pinakamahalagang kagamitan pang-emerhensiya na ginagamit upang kontrolin ang maliliit na sunog bago ito lumaki at hindi na makontrol.\'","choice_a_en":"To extinguish all types of fires, regardless of size.","choice_a_fil":"Upang apulahin ang lahat ng uri ng sunog, anuman ang laki.","choice_b_en":"To control small fires before they become uncontrollable.","choice_b_fil":"Upang kontrolin ang maliliit na sunog bago ito lumaki at hindi na makontrol.","choice_c_en":"To provide a temporary barrier against spreading flames.","choice_c_fil":"Upang magbigay ng pansamantalang harang laban sa lumalaganap na apoy.","choice_d_en":"To alert emergency services to a fire incident.","choice_d_fil":"Upang alertuhin ang mga serbisyo ng emerhensiya tungkol sa insidente ng sunog."},{"number":2,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which type of fire extinguisher is specifically NOT recommended for use on electrical fires or flammable liquid fires?","question_fil":"Aling uri ng fire extinguisher ang partikular na HINDI inirerekomenda para gamitin sa sunog na dulot ng kuryente o sa sunog ng mga nasusunog na likido?","explanation_en":"The lesson content specifies for Water Fire Extinguishers: \'Do NOT use on electrical or flammable liquid fires.\'","explanation_fil":"Ang nilalaman ng aralin ay partikular na nagsasaad para sa mga Water Fire Extinguisher: \'HUWAG gamitin sa sunog na dulot ng kuryente o sa sunog ng mga nasusunog na likido.\'","choice_a_en":"Dry Chemical Powder (ABC)","choice_a_fil":"Dry Chemical Powder (ABC)","choice_b_en":"Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082)","choice_b_fil":"Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082)","choice_c_en":"Water Fire Extinguisher","choice_c_fil":"Water Fire Extinguisher","choice_d_en":"Foam Fire Extinguisher","choice_d_fil":"Foam Fire Extinguisher"},{"number":3,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"A Dry Chemical Powder (ABC) extinguisher is commonly found in various facilities because it is suitable for which fire types?","question_fil":"Ang Dry Chemical Powder (ABC) extinguisher ay karaniwang makikita sa iba\'t ibang pasilidad dahil ito ay angkop para sa anong uri ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states that Dry Chemical Powder (ABC) is \'Suitable for: Class A, Class B, Class C.\'","explanation_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ang Dry Chemical Powder (ABC) ay \'Angkop para sa: Class A, Class B, Class C na sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"Class A and Class B fires only.","choice_a_fil":"Sunog ng Class A at Class B lamang.","choice_b_en":"Class B and Class C fires only.","choice_b_fil":"Sunog ng Class B at Class C lamang.","choice_c_en":"Class A, Class B, and Class C fires.","choice_c_fil":"Sunog ng Class A, Class B, at Class C.","choice_d_en":"Electrical and flammable liquid fires only.","choice_d_fil":"Sunog na dulot ng kuryente at nasusunog na likido lamang."},{"number":4,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which fire extinguisher type is ideal for protecting computers and server rooms because it leaves no residue?","question_fil":"Aling uri ng fire extinguisher ang perpekto para sa pagprotekta sa mga computer at server room dahil wala itong iniiwan na residue?","explanation_en":"The lesson states that Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082) \'Leaves no residue, making it ideal for protecting computers, electrical equipment, and server rooms.\'","explanation_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ang Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082) ay \'Walang iniiwan na residue, kaya ito ay perpekto para sa pagprotekta sa mga computer, kagamitang de-kuryente, at server room.\'","choice_a_en":"Water Fire Extinguisher","choice_a_fil":"Water Fire Extinguisher","choice_b_en":"Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082)","choice_b_fil":"Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082)","choice_c_en":"Foam Fire Extinguisher","choice_c_fil":"Foam Fire Extinguisher","choice_d_en":"Dry Chemical Powder (ABC)","choice_d_fil":"Dry Chemical Powder (ABC)"},{"number":5,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"For which fire classes is a Foam Fire Extinguisher suitable?","question_fil":"Para sa anong mga uri ng sunog ang Foam Fire Extinguisher?","explanation_en":"The lesson indicates Foam Fire Extinguisher is \'Suitable for: Class A, Class B Fires.\'","explanation_fil":"Isinasaad ng aralin na ang Foam Fire Extinguisher ay \'Angkop para sa: Sunog ng Class A, Class B.\'","choice_a_en":"Class A only","choice_a_fil":"Class A lamang","choice_b_en":"Class B only","choice_b_fil":"Class B lamang","choice_c_en":"Class A and Class B","choice_c_fil":"Class A at Class B","choice_d_en":"Class A, Class B, and Class C","choice_d_fil":"Class A, Class B, at Class C"},{"number":6,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Before using a fire extinguisher, what is one crucial question you should ask yourself regarding your safety?","question_fil":"Bago gamitin ang isang fire extinguisher, ano ang isang mahalagang tanong na dapat mong itanong sa iyong sarili tungkol sa iyong kaligtasan?","explanation_en":"The \'Before Using a Fire Extinguisher\' section lists: \'\\u2714 Is there a clear escape route behind you?\'","explanation_fil":"Nakalista sa seksyong \'Bago Gamitin ang Fire Extinguisher\': \'\\u2714 May malinaw ba na ruta ng pagtakas sa iyong likuran?\'","choice_a_en":"Is the extinguisher fully charged?","choice_a_fil":"Puno ba ang charge ng extinguisher?","choice_b_en":"Is there a clear escape route behind you?","choice_b_fil":"May malinaw ba na ruta ng pagtakas sa iyong likuran?","choice_c_en":"Have all valuables been secured?","choice_c_fil":"Nai-secure na ba ang lahat ng mahahalagang bagay?","choice_d_en":"Is the fire alarm system functioning properly?","choice_d_fil":"Gumagana ba nang maayos ang fire alarm system?"},{"number":7,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"When should immediate evacuation be considered the safest option, according to the lesson?","question_fil":"Kailan dapat ituring na pinakaligtas na opsyon ang agarang paglikas, ayon sa aralin?","explanation_en":"The \'Why Fire Extinguishers are Important\' section states: \'if the fire grows rapidly, spreads to multiple areas, or produces excessive smoke, personal safety should always take priority over firefighting.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakalista sa seksyong \'Bakit Mahalaga ang Fire Extinguisher\': \'kung mabilis na lumalaki ang sunog, kumakalat sa maraming lugar, o naglalabas ng labis na usok, laging dapat unahin ang personal na kaligtasan kaysa sa pagpatay ng sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"If the fire alarm has not yet been activated.","choice_a_fil":"Kung hindi pa naaktibo ang fire alarm.","choice_b_en":"If you are unsure of the fire extinguisher\'s expiration date.","choice_b_fil":"Kung hindi ka sigurado sa expiration date ng fire extinguisher.","choice_c_en":"If the fire grows rapidly, spreads, or produces excessive smoke.","choice_c_fil":"Kung mabilis na lumalaki ang sunog, kumakalat, o naglalabas ng labis na usok.","choice_d_en":"If emergency responders have not yet arrived on the scene.","choice_d_fil":"Kung hindi pa nakarating ang mga emergency responder sa pinangyarihan."},{"number":8,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What does the \'P\' in the PASS Technique stand for?","question_fil":"Ano ang ibig sabihin ng \'P\' sa Teknikong PASS?","explanation_en":"The PASS Technique section clearly states: \'P \\u2014 Pull the Pin\'.","explanation_fil":"Malinaw na nakasaad sa seksyon ng Teknikong PASS: \'P \\u2014 Pull the Pin\'.","choice_a_en":"Point","choice_a_fil":"Point","choice_b_en":"Prevent","choice_b_fil":"Prevent","choice_c_en":"Pull","choice_c_fil":"Pull","choice_d_en":"Protect","choice_d_fil":"Protect"},{"number":9,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"When performing the \'Aim\' step of the PASS Technique, where should the nozzle be directed?","question_fil":"Kapag ginagawa ang hakbang na \'Aim\' (Itutok) ng Teknikong PASS, saan dapat itutok ang nozzle?","explanation_en":"The lesson states for \'Aim\': \'Aim the nozzle at the base of the fire, not at the flames.\'","explanation_fil":"Ayon sa aralin para sa \'Aim\': \'Itutok ang nozzle sa paanan ng apoy, hindi sa mismong ningas.\'","choice_a_en":"Directly at the center of the flames.","choice_a_fil":"Direkta sa gitna ng apoy.","choice_b_en":"At the top of the smoke plume.","choice_b_fil":"Sa itaas ng usok.","choice_c_en":"At the base of the fire.","choice_c_fil":"Sa paanan ng apoy.","choice_d_en":"Towards the ceiling to allow the agent to fall.","choice_d_fil":"Pataas sa kisame upang bumagsak ang ahente."},{"number":10,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"During the \'Sweep\' step of the PASS Technique, how should the nozzle be moved?","question_fil":"Sa hakbang na \'Sweep\' (Walisan) ng Teknikong PASS, paano dapat igalaw ang nozzle?","explanation_en":"The lesson states for \'Sweep\': \'Move the nozzle slowly from side to side while aiming at the base of the fire until it is completely extinguished.\'","explanation_fil":"Ayon sa aralin para sa \'Sweep\': \'Igalaw ang nozzle nang dahan-dahan mula sa gilid patungo sa kabilang gilid habang itinatarget ang paanan ng apoy hanggang sa ito ay tuluyang maapula.\'","choice_a_en":"In a circular motion around the fire.","choice_a_fil":"Sa pabilog na galaw sa paligid ng apoy.","choice_b_en":"Quickly up and down the flames.","choice_b_fil":"Mabilis na pataas at pababa sa apoy.","choice_c_en":"Slowly from side to side at the base of the fire.","choice_c_fil":"Dahan-dahan mula sa gilid patungo sa kabilang gilid sa paanan ng apoy.","choice_d_en":"Towards the nearest exit.","choice_d_fil":"Patungo sa pinakamalapit na labasan."},{"number":11,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is an important safety reminder when fighting a fire with an extinguisher?","question_fil":"Alin sa sumusunod ang mahalagang paalala sa kaligtasan kapag nilalabanan ang sunog gamit ang fire extinguisher?","explanation_en":"The \'Important Safety Reminders\' section lists: \'Always keep an exit behind you.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakalista sa seksyong \'Mahahalagang Paalala sa Kaligtasan\': \'Laging siguraduhin na may labasan sa iyong likuran.\'","choice_a_en":"Always turn your back on the fire to protect your eyes.","choice_a_fil":"Palaging talikuran ang apoy upang protektahan ang iyong mga mata.","choice_b_en":"Stand as close as possible to ensure accuracy.","choice_b_fil":"Tumayo nang napakalapit hangga\'t maaari upang matiyak ang pagiging tumpak.","choice_c_en":"Always keep an exit behind you.","choice_c_fil":"Laging siguraduhin na may labasan sa iyong likuran.","choice_d_en":"Continue fighting the fire even if it spreads rapidly.","choice_d_fil":"Ipagpatuloy ang paglaban sa sunog kahit pa mabilis itong kumalat."},{"number":12,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What should you do immediately if smoke becomes excessive while attempting to extinguish a fire?","question_fil":"Ano ang dapat mong agad na gawin kung labis na ang usok habang sinusubukang apulahin ang sunog?","explanation_en":"The \'Important Safety Reminders\' section advises: \'Leave the area immediately if smoke becomes excessive.\'","explanation_fil":"Ang seksyong \'Mahahalagang Paalala sa Kaligtasan\' ay nagpapayo: \'Agad na umalis sa lugar kung labis na ang usok.\'","choice_a_en":"Try to locate the source of the excessive smoke.","choice_a_fil":"Subukang hanapin ang pinagmulan ng labis na usok.","choice_b_en":"Continue fighting the fire while crouching low.","choice_b_fil":"Ipagpatuloy ang paglaban sa sunog habang nakayuko.","choice_c_en":"Leave the area immediately.","choice_c_fil":"Agad na umalis sa lugar.","choice_d_en":"Use a different type of extinguisher.","choice_d_fil":"Gumamit ng ibang uri ng extinguisher."},{"number":13,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which class of fire involves ordinary combustible materials like wood, paper, and cloth?","question_fil":"Aling klase ng sunog ang kinasasangkutan ng karaniwang nasusunog na materyales tulad ng kahoy, papel, at tela?","explanation_en":"Under Water Fire Extinguisher, it says \'Suitable for: Class A Fires Examples: Wood Paper Cloth Cardboard.\'","explanation_fil":"Sa ilalim ng Water Fire Extinguisher, nakasaad: \'Angkop para sa: Class A na Sunog Halimbawa: Kahoy, Papel, Tela, Karton.\'","choice_a_en":"Class B","choice_a_fil":"Class B","choice_b_en":"Class C","choice_b_fil":"Class C","choice_c_en":"Class A","choice_c_fil":"Class A","choice_d_en":"Class D","choice_d_fil":"Class D"},{"number":14,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"According to the lesson, what is a common mistake to avoid when using a fire extinguisher?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang karaniwang pagkakamali na dapat iwasan kapag gumagamit ng fire extinguisher?","explanation_en":"The \'Common Mistakes\' section lists: \'Standing too close to the fire.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakalista sa seksyong \'Karaniwang Pagkakamali\': \'Pagiging masyadong malapit sa sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"Activating the fire alarm before using the extinguisher.","choice_a_fil":"Pag-aktibo ng fire alarm bago gamitin ang extinguisher.","choice_b_en":"Aiming at the base of the fire.","choice_b_fil":"Pag-itutok sa paanan ng apoy.","choice_c_en":"Standing too close to the fire.","choice_c_fil":"Pagiging masyadong malapit sa sunog.","choice_d_en":"Notifying emergency responders after extinguishing the fire.","choice_d_fil":"Pagpapaalam sa mga emergency responder pagkatapos maapula ang sunog."},{"number":15,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"If the answer to any of the questions in the \'Before Using a Fire Extinguisher\' checklist is \'No,\' what is the recommended action?","question_fil":"Kung ang sagot sa alinman sa mga tanong sa checklist na \'Bago Gamitin ang Fire Extinguisher\' ay \'Hindi,\' ano ang inirerekomendang aksyon?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'If the answer to any of these questions is No, evacuate immediately instead of attempting to fight the fire.\'","explanation_fil":"Ayon sa aralin: \'Kung ang sagot sa alinman sa mga tanong na ito ay Hindi, agad na lumikas sa halip na subukang labanan ang sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"Proceed with caution and use the extinguisher.","choice_a_fil":"Magpatuloy nang may pag-iingat at gamitin ang extinguisher.","choice_b_en":"Find someone else to fight the fire.","choice_b_fil":"Humanap ng iba na lalaban sa sunog.","choice_c_en":"Evacuate immediately.","choice_c_fil":"Agad na lumikas.","choice_d_en":"Activate the fire alarm if not already done.","choice_d_fil":"I-aktibo ang fire alarm kung hindi pa nagawa."},{"number":16,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is listed as a learning objective for this lesson?","question_fil":"Alin sa sumusunod ang nakalista bilang layunin ng pagkatuto para sa araling ito?","explanation_en":"One of the Learning Objectives is: \'Recognize situations where using a fire extinguisher is appropriate.\'","explanation_fil":"Isa sa mga Layunin ng Pagkatuto ay: \'Makilala ang mga sitwasyon kung saan angkop ang paggamit ng fire extinguisher.\'","choice_a_en":"To identify the maximum range of different fire extinguishers.","choice_a_fil":"Upang matukoy ang pinakamataas na abot ng iba\'t ibang fire extinguisher.","choice_b_en":"To demonstrate advanced fire suppression techniques.","choice_b_fil":"Upang ipakita ang mga advanced na teknik sa pag-apula ng sunog.","choice_c_en":"To recognize situations where using a fire extinguisher is appropriate.","choice_c_fil":"Upang makilala ang mga sitwasyon kung saan angkop ang paggamit ng fire extinguisher.","choice_d_en":"To perform routine maintenance on fire extinguishers.","choice_d_fil":"Upang magsagawa ng regular na pagpapanatili sa mga fire extinguisher."},{"number":17,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"After successfully extinguishing a fire using the PASS technique, what immediate action is advised?","question_fil":"Matapos matagumpay na maapula ang sunog gamit ang Teknikong PASS, ano ang agarang aksyon na ipinapayo?","explanation_en":"The \'Sweep\' step of the PASS Technique states: \'Continue observing the area in case the fire reignites.\'","explanation_fil":"Ang hakbang na \'Sweep\' (Walisan) ng Teknikong PASS ay nagsasaad: \'Patuloy na obserbahan ang lugar kung sakaling muling magliyab ang apoy.\'","choice_a_en":"Store the extinguisher back in its place.","choice_a_fil":"Ibalik ang extinguisher sa lalagyan nito.","choice_b_en":"Turn your back on the area and leave.","choice_b_fil":"Talikuran ang lugar at umalis.","choice_c_en":"Continue observing the area in case the fire reignites.","choice_c_fil":"Patuloy na obserbahan ang lugar kung sakaling muling magliyab ang apoy.","choice_d_en":"Immediately report the incident to local media.","choice_d_fil":"Agad na iulat ang insidente sa lokal na media."},{"number":18,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"Which of these is explicitly listed as a safety reminder to avoid?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga ito ang tahasang nakalista bilang paalala sa kaligtasan na dapat iwasan?","explanation_en":"The \'Important Safety Reminders\' section includes: \'Never use water on electrical fires.\' Options A, C, D are implied or relate to other points, but B is a direct \'never\' statement.","explanation_fil":"Kasama sa seksyong \'Mahahalagang Paalala sa Kaligtasan\': \'Huwag na huwag gumamit ng tubig sa sunog na dulot ng kuryente.\' Ang mga opsyon A, C, D ay ipinahiwatig o may kaugnayan sa ibang punto, ngunit ang B ay isang direktang pahayag na \'huwag na huwag\'.","choice_a_en":"Standing too far from the fire.","choice_a_fil":"Pagiging masyadong malayo sa sunog.","choice_b_en":"Never using water on electrical fires.","choice_b_fil":"Huwag na huwag gumamit ng tubig sa sunog na dulot ng kuryente.","choice_c_en":"Activating the fire alarm late.","choice_c_fil":"Huling pag-aktibo ng fire alarm.","choice_d_en":"Not having an escape route.","choice_d_fil":"Walang ruta ng pagtakas."},{"number":19,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What characteristic makes Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082) extinguishers suitable for server rooms?","question_fil":"Anong katangian ang nagpapaging angkop sa mga Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082) extinguisher para sa mga server room?","explanation_en":"The content states: \'Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082) ... Leaves no residue, making it ideal for protecting computers, electrical equipment, and server rooms.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakalista sa nilalaman: \'Carbon Dioxide (CO\\u2082) ... Walang iniiwan na residue, kaya ito ay perpekto para sa pagprotekta sa mga computer, kagamitang de-kuryente, at server room.\'","choice_a_en":"Their ability to cool burning materials effectively.","choice_a_fil":"Ang kanilang kakayahang palamigin nang epektibo ang mga nasusunog na materyales.","choice_b_en":"Their effectiveness against Class A fires.","choice_b_fil":"Ang kanilang pagiging epektibo laban sa Class A na sunog.","choice_c_en":"The fact that they leave no residue.","choice_c_fil":"Ang katotohanang wala silang iniiwan na residue.","choice_d_en":"Their suitability for flammable liquid fires only.","choice_d_fil":"Ang kanilang pagiging angkop para sa sunog ng nasusunog na likido lamang."},{"number":20,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"According to the lesson, when does personal safety take priority over firefighting?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, kailan dapat unahin ang personal na kaligtasan kaysa sa paglaban sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states: \'if the fire grows rapidly, spreads to multiple areas, or produces excessive smoke, personal safety should always take priority over firefighting.\'","explanation_fil":"Ayon sa aralin: \'kung mabilis na lumalaki ang sunog, kumakalat sa maraming lugar, o naglalabas ng labis na usok, laging dapat unahin ang personal na kaligtasan kaysa sa paglaban sa sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"Only when you don\'t know the PASS technique.","choice_a_fil":"Kapag hindi mo lang alam ang Teknikong PASS.","choice_b_en":"When the fire is small but producing some smoke.","choice_b_fil":"Kapag maliit ang sunog ngunit naglalabas ng kaunting usok.","choice_c_en":"If the fire grows rapidly, spreads, or produces excessive smoke.","choice_c_fil":"Kung mabilis na lumalaki ang sunog, kumakalat, o naglalabas ng labis na usok.","choice_d_en":"After emergency responders have arrived and taken over.","choice_d_fil":"Pagkatapos dumating at mangasiwa ang mga emergency responder."}]', 'en', '{"en":{"status":"published","outdated":false,"published_at":"2026-07-17T00:09:11+08:00"},"fil":{"status":"draft","outdated":false,"translated_at":"2026-07-17T00:05:45+08:00"}}', 'AI Generated', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-16 16:09:11', 3, 3, '2026-07-16 16:05:45', '2026-07-16 16:04:59', '2026-07-16 16:09:11'),
	(7, 7, 1, 'published', '[{"number":1,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is the primary definition of first aid according to the lesson?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang pangunahing kahulugan ng unang lunas?","explanation_en":"The lesson defines first aid as \'the immediate care provided to an injured or ill person before professional medical help arrives.\'","explanation_fil":"Binibigyang kahulugan ng aralin ang unang lunas bilang \'ang agad na pangangalaga na ibinibigay sa isang taong nasugatan o nagkasakit bago dumating ang propesyonal na tulong medikal.\'","choice_a_en":"Professional medical treatment provided in a hospital.","choice_a_fil":"Propesyonal na paggamot medikal na ibinibigay sa isang ospital.","choice_b_en":"Immediate care provided to an injured or ill person before professional medical help arrives.","choice_b_fil":"Agad na pangangalaga na ibinibigay sa isang taong nasugatan o nagkasakit bago dumating ang propesyonal na tulong medikal.","choice_c_en":"Long-term rehabilitation for fire-related injuries.","choice_c_fil":"Pangmatagalang rehabilitasyon para sa mga pinsalang dulot ng sunog.","choice_d_en":"The process of calling emergency services only.","choice_d_fil":"Ang proseso ng pagtawag lamang sa mga serbisyong pang-emergency."},{"number":2,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"D","question_en":"Which of the following is NOT listed as a goal of first aid?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang HINDI nakalista bilang layunin ng unang lunas?","explanation_en":"The goals of first aid are to preserve life, prevent injury from worsening, and promote recovery. Diagnosing the exact cause is not listed.","explanation_fil":"Ang mga layunin ng unang lunas ay panatilihin ang buhay, pigilan ang paglala ng pinsala, at itaguyod ang paggaling. Hindi nakalista ang pagsusuri sa eksaktong sanhi.","choice_a_en":"Preserve life.","choice_a_fil":"Panatilihin ang buhay.","choice_b_en":"Promote recovery.","choice_b_fil":"Itaguyod ang paggaling.","choice_c_en":"Prevent the injury from becoming worse.","choice_c_fil":"Pigilan ang paglala ng pinsala.","choice_d_en":"Diagnose the exact cause of injury.","choice_d_fil":"Suriin ang eksaktong sanhi ng pinsala."},{"number":3,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is listed as a common fire-related injury?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang nakalista bilang karaniwang pinsala na dulot ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists \'Heat exhaustion\' as one of the common fire-related injuries.","explanation_fil":"Nakalista sa aralin ang \'Pagkapagod sa init (Heat exhaustion)\' bilang isa sa mga karaniwang pinsala na dulot ng sunog.","choice_a_en":"Allergic reactions.","choice_a_fil":"Mga reaksyong alerhiya.","choice_b_en":"Sprained ankles.","choice_b_fil":"Pilay sa bukung-bukong.","choice_c_en":"Heat exhaustion.","choice_c_fil":"Pagkapagod sa init (Heat exhaustion).","choice_d_en":"Food poisoning.","choice_d_fil":"Pagkalason sa pagkain."},{"number":4,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is the immediate first step for treating minor burns, according to the lesson?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, ano ang agad na unang hakbang sa paggamot ng mga minor na paso?","explanation_en":"For minor burns, the first step is to \'Move the victim away from the heat source.\'","explanation_fil":"Para sa mga minor na paso, ang unang hakbang ay \'Ilipat ang biktima palayo sa pinagmulan ng init.\'","choice_a_en":"Apply butter to the burned area.","choice_a_fil":"Lagyan ng mantikilya ang napasong bahagi.","choice_b_en":"Move the victim away from the heat source.","choice_b_fil":"Ilipat ang biktima palayo sa pinagmulan ng init.","choice_c_en":"Pop any blisters that have formed.","choice_c_fil":"Pumutok ang anumang paltos na nabuo.","choice_d_en":"Cover the burn with a dry cloth.","choice_d_fil":"Takpan ang paso ng tuyong tela."},{"number":5,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"For how long should a minor burn be cooled under cool running water?","question_fil":"Gaano katagal dapat palamigin ang isang minor na paso sa ilalim ng malamig na tubig na umaagos?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Cool the burned area under cool running water for at least 20 minutes.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin, \'Palamigin ang napasong bahagi sa ilalim ng malamig na tubig na umaagos nang hindi bababa sa 20 minuto.\'","choice_a_en":"5 minutes.","choice_a_fil":"5 minuto.","choice_b_en":"At least 10 minutes.","choice_b_fil":"Hindi bababa sa 10 minuto.","choice_c_en":"At least 20 minutes.","choice_c_fil":"Hindi bababa sa 20 minuto.","choice_d_en":"Until the pain stops completely.","choice_d_fil":"Hanggang sa tuluyang mawala ang sakit."},{"number":6,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"According to the lesson, which substance should NOT be applied to a minor burn?","question_fil":"Ayon sa aralin, aling substansya ang HINDI dapat ilagay sa isang minor na paso?","explanation_en":"The lesson explicitly states, \'Do not apply: Toothpaste, Butter, Ice, Cooking oil, Ointments unless advised by medical professionals.\'","explanation_fil":"Malinaw na nakasaad sa aralin, \'Huwag ilagay: Toothpaste, Mantikilya, Yelo, Mantika, Mga pamahid maliban kung ipinapayo ng mga propesyonal sa medisina.\'","choice_a_en":"Clean, sterile non-stick dressing.","choice_a_fil":"Malinis, isteril, hindi dumidikit na panakip.","choice_b_en":"Cool running water.","choice_b_fil":"Malamig na tubig na umaagos.","choice_c_en":"Toothpaste.","choice_c_fil":"Toothpaste.","choice_d_en":"An ointment, if advised by medical professionals.","choice_d_fil":"Isang pamahid, kung ipinapayo ng mga propesyonal sa medisina."},{"number":7,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which of the following is a common sign of smoke inhalation?","question_fil":"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang karaniwang tanda ng paglanghap ng usok?","explanation_en":"Common signs of smoke inhalation include \'Persistent coughing,\' difficulty breathing, dizziness, headache, black soot, and confusion.","explanation_fil":"Ang mga karaniwang tanda ng paglanghap ng usok ay kinabibilangan ng \'Patuloy na pag-ubo,\' hirap sa paghinga, pagkahilo, pananakit ng ulo, itim na uling, at pagkalito.","choice_a_en":"Clear skin with no visible soot.","choice_a_fil":"Malinaw na balat na walang nakikitang uling.","choice_b_en":"Increased energy and alertness.","choice_b_fil":"Pagtaas ng enerhiya at pagiging alisto.","choice_c_en":"Persistent coughing.","choice_c_fil":"Patuloy na pag-ubo.","choice_d_en":"Feeling overly warm.","choice_d_fil":"Pakiramdam ng sobrang init."},{"number":8,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"What is the immediate action to take for someone showing signs of smoke inhalation?","question_fil":"Ano ang agarang aksyon na dapat gawin para sa isang taong nagpapakita ng mga tanda ng paglanghap ng usok?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Move the person to fresh air immediately and seek medical attention.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin, \'Ilipat agad ang tao sa sariwang hangin at humingi ng medikal na atensyon.\'","choice_a_en":"Give them a glass of water.","choice_a_fil":"Bigyan sila ng isang basong tubig.","choice_b_en":"Move the person to fresh air immediately and seek medical attention.","choice_b_fil":"Ilipat agad ang tao sa sariwang hangin at humingi ng medikal na atensyon.","choice_c_en":"Apply a cold compress to their forehead.","choice_c_fil":"Lagyan ng malamig na compress ang kanilang noo.","choice_d_en":"Cover their nose and mouth with a wet cloth and keep them in the smoky area.","choice_d_fil":"Takpan ang kanilang ilong at bibig ng basang tela at panatilihin sila sa mausok na lugar."},{"number":9,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Before giving first aid to an injured person, what is the most important step listed?","question_fil":"Bago magbigay ng unang lunas sa isang nasugatang tao, ano ang pinakamahalagang hakbang na nakalista?","explanation_en":"The lesson emphasizes, \'Before giving first aid: Ensure the area is safe. Protect yourself first.\'","explanation_fil":"Binibigyang-diin ng aralin, \'Bago magbigay ng unang lunas: Siguraduhin na ligtas ang lugar. Protektahan ang sarili muna.\'","choice_a_en":"Reassure the injured person.","choice_a_fil":"Panataghin ang nasugatang tao.","choice_b_en":"Stay calm.","choice_b_fil":"Manatiling kalmado.","choice_c_en":"Ensure the area is safe.","choice_c_fil":"Siguraduhin na ligtas ang lugar.","choice_d_en":"Call emergency responders immediately.","choice_d_fil":"Tumawag agad sa mga tagatugon sa emergency."},{"number":10,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"When should professional medical assistance be sought immediately during a fire emergency?","question_fil":"Kailan dapat agad humingi ng propesyonal na tulong medikal sa panahon ng isang emergency sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson lists, \'Immediately seek professional medical assistance if: The fire involved chemicals or electricity.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakalista sa aralin, \'Agad humingi ng propesyonal na tulong medikal kung: Ang sunog ay kinasasangkutan ng mga kemikal o kuryente.\'","choice_a_en":"If the burn is very small.","choice_a_fil":"Kung napakaliit ng paso.","choice_b_en":"If the victim is only slightly confused.","choice_b_fil":"Kung bahagya lamang nalilito ang biktima.","choice_c_en":"If the fire involved chemicals or electricity.","choice_c_fil":"Kung ang sunog ay kinasasangkutan ng mga kemikal o kuryente.","choice_d_en":"If the victim feels a little dizzy but is otherwise fine.","choice_d_fil":"Kung ang biktima ay nakaramdam lamang ng bahagyang pagkahilo ngunit maayos naman."},{"number":11,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"A burn on which body part would immediately warrant professional medical assistance?","question_fil":"Ang paso sa aling bahagi ng katawan ang agarang nangangailangan ng propesyonal na tulong medikal?","explanation_en":"The lesson states to seek immediate medical assistance if \'Burns involve the face, hands, feet, or genitals.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na humingi ng agarang tulong medikal kung \'Ang mga paso ay kinasasangkutan ng mukha, kamay, paa, o ari.\'","choice_a_en":"Forearm.","choice_a_fil":"Braso.","choice_b_en":"Thigh.","choice_b_fil":"Hita.","choice_c_en":"Foot.","choice_c_fil":"Paa.","choice_d_en":"Shoulder.","choice_d_fil":"Balikat."},{"number":12,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"Which action is listed as a common mistake to avoid in first aid during fire emergencies?","question_fil":"Aling aksyon ang nakalista bilang karaniwang pagkakamali na dapat iwasan sa unang lunas sa panahon ng emergency sa sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Do not: Pop blisters.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin, \'Huwag: Paputukin ang mga paltos.\'","choice_a_en":"Calling emergency responders.","choice_a_fil":"Pagtawag sa mga tagatugon sa emergency.","choice_b_en":"Covering a burn with a sterile dressing.","choice_b_fil":"Pagtatakip ng paso ng isteril na panakip.","choice_c_en":"Popping blisters.","choice_c_fil":"Pagpapaputok ng mga paltos.","choice_d_en":"Moving a victim away from a heat source.","choice_d_fil":"Paglilipat ng biktima palayo sa pinagmulan ng init."},{"number":13,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What should NOT be delayed when dealing with fire-related injuries?","question_fil":"Ano ang HINDI dapat ipagpaliban kapag nakikitungo sa mga pinsalang dulot ng sunog?","explanation_en":"The lesson advises, \'Do not: Delay calling emergency responders.\'","explanation_fil":"Ipinapayo ng aralin, \'Huwag: Ipagpaliban ang pagtawag sa mga tagatugon sa emergency.\'","choice_a_en":"Cooling a minor burn.","choice_a_fil":"Pagpapalamig ng minor na paso.","choice_b_en":"Reassuring the injured person.","choice_b_fil":"Pagpapapanatag sa nasugatang tao.","choice_c_en":"Calling emergency responders for serious injuries.","choice_c_fil":"Pagtawag sa mga tagatugon sa emergency para sa malubhang pinsala.","choice_d_en":"Applying a sterile dressing.","choice_d_fil":"Paglalagay ng isteril na panakip."},{"number":14,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"B","question_en":"According to the lesson overview, providing proper first aid during the first few minutes after an incident can help reduce what?","question_fil":"Ayon sa pangkalahatang-ideya ng aralin, ang pagbibigay ng tamang unang lunas sa unang ilang minuto pagkatapos ng insidente ay makakatulong na mabawasan ang ano?","explanation_en":"The lesson overview states, \'Providing proper first aid during the first few minutes after an incident can help reduce the severity of injuries and improve the chances of recovery.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa pangkalahatang-ideya ng aralin, \'Ang pagbibigay ng tamang unang lunas sa unang ilang minuto pagkatapos ng insidente ay makakatulong na mabawasan ang kalubhaan ng mga pinsala at mapabuti ang pagkakataon ng paggaling.\'","choice_a_en":"The need for any professional medical help.","choice_a_fil":"Ang pangangailangan para sa anumang propesyonal na tulong medikal.","choice_b_en":"The severity of injuries and improve chances of recovery.","choice_b_fil":"Ang kalubhaan ng mga pinsala at mapabuti ang pagkakataon ng paggaling.","choice_c_en":"The amount of smoke in the area.","choice_c_fil":"Ang dami ng usok sa lugar.","choice_d_en":"The emotional impact on bystanders.","choice_d_fil":"Ang emosyonal na epekto sa mga nakasaksi."},{"number":15,"competency":"safety_awareness","correct_answer":"A","question_en":"What is highlighted as a key takeaway regarding safety?","question_fil":"Ano ang binibigyang-diin bilang isang mahalagang aral tungkol sa kaligtasan?","explanation_en":"One of the Key Takeaways is \'Always prioritize scene safety.\'","explanation_fil":"Isa sa mga Mahalagang Aral ay \'Laging unahin ang kaligtasan ng pinangyarihan.\'","choice_a_en":"Always prioritize scene safety.","choice_a_fil":"Laging unahin ang kaligtasan ng pinangyarihan.","choice_b_en":"Always move seriously injured victims.","choice_b_fil":"Laging ilipat ang mga biktima na malubhang nasugatan.","choice_c_en":"Always apply home remedies first.","choice_c_fil":"Laging gumamit muna ng mga panlunas na gawa sa bahay.","choice_d_en":"Always ignore minor breathing difficulties.","choice_d_fil":"Laging balewalain ang minor na hirap sa paghinga."},{"number":16,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"One of the learning objectives of this lesson is for participants to be able to identify what?","question_fil":"Isa sa mga layunin ng pagkatuto ng araling ito ay upang matukoy ng mga kalahok ang ano?","explanation_en":"A learning objective is \'Identify common injuries caused by fires.\'","explanation_fil":"Ang layunin ng pagkatuto ay \'Matukoy ang mga karaniwang pinsala na dulot ng sunog.\'","choice_a_en":"The chemical composition of smoke.","choice_a_fil":"Ang komposisyong kemikal ng usok.","choice_b_en":"Advanced surgical techniques for burns.","choice_b_fil":"Mga advanced na teknik ng operasyon para sa paso.","choice_c_en":"Common injuries caused by fires.","choice_c_fil":"Mga karaniwang pinsala na dulot ng sunog.","choice_d_en":"The exact temperature of a fire.","choice_d_fil":"Ang eksaktong temperatura ng apoy."},{"number":17,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"When should you immediately seek professional medical assistance regarding a burn victim?","question_fil":"Kailan dapat agad humingi ng propesyonal na tulong medikal tungkol sa isang biktima ng paso?","explanation_en":"The lesson states to \'Immediately seek professional medical assistance if: The victim loses consciousness.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin na \'Agad humingi ng propesyonal na tulong medikal kung: Ang biktima ay nawalan ng malay.\'","choice_a_en":"If the victim is conscious and responsive.","choice_a_fil":"Kung ang biktima ay may malay at tumutugon.","choice_b_en":"If the victim only has minor burns.","choice_b_fil":"Kung minor lamang ang paso ng biktima.","choice_c_en":"If the victim loses consciousness.","choice_c_fil":"Kung nawalan ng malay ang biktima.","choice_d_en":"If the victim can talk clearly.","choice_d_fil":"Kung malinaw na makapagsalita ang biktima."},{"number":18,"competency":"decision_making","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"After cooling a minor burn, what is the next recommended step from the lesson?","question_fil":"Pagkatapos palamigin ang isang minor na paso, ano ang susunod na inirerekomendang hakbang mula sa aralin?","explanation_en":"For minor burns, after cooling, the next step is to \'Cover the burn with a clean, sterile, non-stick dressing.\'","explanation_fil":"Para sa mga minor na paso, pagkatapos palamigin, ang susunod na hakbang ay \'Takpan ang paso ng malinis, isteril, hindi dumidikit na panakip.\'","choice_a_en":"Apply ice directly to the burn.","choice_a_fil":"Direktang lagyan ng yelo ang paso.","choice_b_en":"Leave the burn exposed to air.","choice_b_fil":"Iwanang nakalantad sa hangin ang paso.","choice_c_en":"Cover the burn with a clean, sterile, non-stick dressing.","choice_c_fil":"Takpan ang paso ng malinis, isteril, hindi dumidikit na panakip.","choice_d_en":"Rub the burn area vigorously.","choice_d_fil":"Kuskusin nang mariin ang bahaging napaso."},{"number":19,"competency":"knowledge","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"What specific action is mentioned as a common mistake to avoid regarding blisters?","question_fil":"Anong partikular na aksyon ang binanggit bilang karaniwang pagkakamali na dapat iwasan tungkol sa mga paltos?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Do not: Pop blisters.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin, \'Huwag: Paputukin ang mga paltos.\'","choice_a_en":"Cool them with water.","choice_a_fil":"Palamigin ang mga ito ng tubig.","choice_b_en":"Cover them with a dressing.","choice_b_fil":"Takpan ang mga ito ng panakip.","choice_c_en":"Pop them.","choice_c_fil":"Paputukin ang mga ito.","choice_d_en":"Show them to a doctor.","choice_d_fil":"Ipakita ang mga ito sa doktor."},{"number":20,"competency":"emergency_response","correct_answer":"C","question_en":"If a person affected by fire has difficulty breathing, what is the recommended immediate action from the lesson?","question_fil":"Kung ang isang taong apektado ng sunog ay nahihirapang huminga, ano ang inirerekomendang agarang aksyon mula sa aralin?","explanation_en":"The lesson states, \'Immediately seek professional medical assistance if: The victim has difficulty breathing.\' Also, \'Do not: Ignore breathing difficulties.\'","explanation_fil":"Nakasaad sa aralin, \'Agad humingi ng propesyonal na tulong medikal kung: Ang biktima ay nahihirapan sa paghinga.\' Gayundin, \'Huwag: Balewalain ang hirap sa paghinga.\'","choice_a_en":"Ignore it and treat other injuries first.","choice_a_fil":"Balewalain ito at gamutin muna ang ibang pinsala.","choice_b_en":"Give them a warm drink.","choice_b_fil":"Bigyan sila ng mainit na inumin.","choice_c_en":"Immediately seek professional medical assistance.","choice_c_fil":"Agad humingi ng propesyonal na tulong medikal.","choice_d_en":"Ask them to hold their breath.","choice_d_fil":"Hilingin sa kanila na pigilin ang kanilang paghinga."}]', 'en', '{"en":{"status":"published","outdated":false,"published_at":"2026-07-18T22:26:16+08:00"},"fil":{"status":"draft","outdated":false,"translated_at":"2026-07-18T21:38:43+08:00"}}', 'AI Generated', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-18 14:25:29', 3, 3, '2026-07-18 13:38:43', '2026-07-18 13:38:02', '2026-07-18 14:26:16');
